"på siden med en kort besked. Produkter med valgmuligheder, der skal vælges, "
"åbner i stedet deres produktside."

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:77
msgid "Store colours for every widget"
msgstr "Webshoppens farver til alle widgets"

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:77
msgid ""
"Elementor › Site Settings › WP EasyCart sets price, sale, badge and button "
"colours, button and price typography, corners and spacing for all WP "
"EasyCart widgets at once. They start from your Global Colors."
msgstr ""
"Elementor › Webstedsindstillinger › WP EasyCart angiver farver for pris, "
"tilbud, mærker og knapper, typografi for knapper og priser, hjørner og "
"afstand for alle WP EasyCart-widgets på én gang. De tager udgangspunkt i "
"dine globale farver."

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:78
msgid ""
"On a site with a page cache, show the cart count in your header with the "
"Cart count tag (it updates itself) or the Menu Cart widget. Pages with the "
"Customer first name tag, or an element shown by a WP EasyCart display "
"condition ( cart, customer, product ), are never cached."
msgstr ""
"På et websted med sidecache skal du vise antallet i kurven i din header med "
"tagget Antal i kurven (det opdaterer sig selv) eller Menukurv-widgetten. "
"Sider med tagget Kundens fornavn eller et element, der vises af en WP "
"EasyCart-visningsbetingelse ( kurv, kunde, produkt ), caches aldrig."

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:86
msgid "These need Elementor Pro."
msgstr "Disse kræver Elementor Pro."

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:88
msgid "Product cards with Loop Grid"
msgstr "Produktkort med Loop Grid"

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:88
msgid ""
"Design a Loop Item with the WP EasyCart tags or widgets, add a Loop Grid or "
"Loop Carousel, set Query › Source to Store Items and type one of these in "
"Query ID:"
msgstr ""
"Design et Loop Item med WP EasyCart-tags eller -widgets, tilføj et Loop Grid "
"eller Loop Carousel, sæt Query › Source til Store Items, og skriv en af "
"disse i Query ID:"

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:96
msgid ""
"Categories and manufacturers never show up as cards, and neither do inactive "
"products or products for another customer role."
msgstr ""
"Kategorier og producenter vises aldrig som kort, og det gør inaktive "
"produkter eller produkter til en anden kunderolle heller ikke."

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:97
msgid "Newsletter sign-up from any form"
msgstr "Tilmelding til nyhedsbrev fra enhver formular"

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:97
msgid ""
"In a Form widget, add \"Add to WP EasyCart newsletter\" to Actions After "
"Submit and an Acceptance field (for example \"Send me news and offers\", not "
"ticked in advance and not required). Only visitors who tick it are added to "
"Marketing › Subscribers, with \"Elementor form\" as the source."
msgstr ""
"I et Formular-widget skal du tilføje \"Tilføj til WP EasyCart-nyhedsbrev\" "
"under Handlinger efter indsendelse samt et Accept-felt (for eksempel \"Send "
"mig nyheder og tilbud\", ikke afkrydset på forhånd og ikke påkrævet). Kun "
"besøgende, der afkrydser det, tilføjes til Marketing › Abonnenter med "
"\"Elementor-formular\" som kilde."

#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-settings.php:97
#: admin/elementor/modules/dynamic/pro/class-wp-easycart-elementor-dynamic-form-action.php:73
msgid ""
"Add a Honeypot or reCAPTCHA field to the form too, so bots cannot sign up "
"made-up addresses."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj også et Honeypot- eller reCAPTCHA-felt til formularen, så bots ikke "
"kan tilmelde opdigtede adresser."

