#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:143
msgid ""
"Checkout protection is waiting for its database table, so nothing is being "
"checked yet. Repair the database with the link at the top of this page."
msgstr ""
"Kassebeskyttelsen venter på sin databasetabel, så der kontrolleres ikke "
"noget endnu. Reparer databasen med linket øverst på siden."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:147
msgid ""
"Checkout protection is off. Nothing stops bots from testing stolen cards at "
"your checkout, and each declined test can cost you a card fee."
msgstr ""
"Kassebeskyttelsen er slået fra. Intet forhindrer bots i at teste stjålne "
"kort i din kasse, og hver afvist test kan koste dig et kortgebyr."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:151
msgid ""
"Checkout protection is only watching: it records card testing but does not "
"stop it."
msgstr ""
"Kassebeskyttelsen overvåger kun: den registrerer korttest, men stopper dem "
"ikke."

#. translators: %s: time the extra checks end.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:157
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Bots are testing cards at your checkout right now. Extra checks are on until "
"%s; review small orders placed during the attack."
msgstr ""
"Bots tester kort i din kasse lige nu. Ekstra kontroller er slået til indtil "
"%s; gennemgå små ordrer afgivet under angrebet."

#. translators: %s: protection level.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:162
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Checkout protection is on ( %s ), without a human check: during an attack, "
"payments that didn't come from your checkout page are refused instead of "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Kassebeskyttelsen er slået til ( %s ), uden menneskekontrol: under et angreb "
"afvises betalinger, der ikke kom fra din kasseside, i stedet for at blive "
"kontrolleret."

#. translators: %s: protection level.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:165
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Checkout protection is on ( %s ), with a human check for shoppers who look "
"like bots."
msgstr ""
"Kassebeskyttelsen er slået til ( %s ), med menneskekontrol for købere, der "
"ligner bots."

#. translators: %s: the provider's error.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:173
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The human check isn't working ( %s ). Payments carry on under stricter "
"limits; check the secret key."
msgstr ""
"Menneskekontrollen virker ikke ( %s ). Betalinger fortsætter under strengere "
"grænser; tjek den hemmelige nøgle."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:212
msgid ""
"The database update for checkout protection has not run yet, so nothing is "
"being checked. Load any EasyCart admin page to run it; if this stays, open "
"Store Status."
msgstr ""
"Databaseopdateringen til kassebeskyttelsen er ikke kørt endnu, så der "
"kontrolleres ikke noget. Åbn en vilkårlig EasyCart-administrationsside for "
"at køre den; hvis dette bliver ved, så åbn Webshopstatus."

