#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:325
msgid "Off."
msgstr "Fra."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:325
msgid ""
"Nothing limits payment attempts. A single bot can run thousands of stolen "
"cards through your checkout, and your payment processor may hold your "
"payouts because of it. We recommend Standard."
msgstr ""
"Intet begrænser betalingsforsøg. En enkelt bot kan køre tusindvis af stjålne "
"kort gennem din kasse, og din betalingsudbyder kan tilbageholde dine "
"udbetalinger på grund af det. Vi anbefaler Standard."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:328
msgid "Watch only."
msgstr "Kun overvågning."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:328
msgid ""
"Nothing is stopped. Everything Standard would have stopped appears in "
"Activity as \"Would stop\", so you can see what it would do on your store "
"before switching it on."
msgstr ""
"Intet bliver stoppet. Alt, hvad Standard ville have stoppet, vises i "
"Aktivitet som »Ville blive stoppet«, så du kan se, hvad det ville gøre i din "
"webshop, før du slår det til."

