#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:335
msgid ""
"For stores where many shoppers share one network, like a school or an office."
msgstr ""
"Til webshops, hvor mange købere deler ét netværk, som en skole eller et "
"kontor."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:336
msgid "Standard."
msgstr "Standard."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:336
msgid "Real shoppers almost never meet it."
msgstr "Rigtige købere møder det næsten aldrig."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:337
msgid "Strict."
msgstr "Streng."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:337
msgid ""
"For stores that have been attacked before, or sell cheap items bots like."
msgstr ""
"Til webshops, der før er blevet angrebet, eller som sælger billige varer, "
"som bots kan lide."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:338
msgid "Custom."
msgstr "Tilpasset."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:338
msgid "Your own numbers, set below."
msgstr "Dine egne tal, indstillet nedenfor."

#. translators: 1: failed payments, 2: minutes, 3: failed payments a day, 4: pause length.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:342
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A shopper can fail %1$d payments in %2$d minutes ( %3$d in a day ) before a "
"%4$s pause. Most people get it right within two tries."
msgstr ""
"En køber kan mislykkes med %1$d betalinger på %2$d minutter ( %3$d på en "
"dag ), før en pause på %4$s. De fleste klarer det inden for to forsøg."

#. translators: %d: failed payments.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:344
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A card that fails %d times in a day is refused until the next day. Stripe "
"and Square cards are only known after a decline, so there the shopper limits "
"above do this job."
msgstr ""
"Et kort, der fejler %d gange på en dag, afvises indtil næste dag. Stripe- og "
"Square-kort kendes først efter en afvisning, så dér klarer købergrænserne "
"ovenfor det arbejde."

#. translators: 1: times the usual rate, 2: declines.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:346
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When declines across your store are %1$s times higher than usual ( at least "
"%2$d in 15 minutes ), everyone gets a human check and each shopper gets the "
"tries set under During an attack."
msgstr ""
"Når afvisninger i hele din webshop er %1$s gange højere end normalt ( mindst "
"%2$d på 15 minutter ), får alle en menneskekontrol, og hver køber får de "
"forsøg, der er indstillet under Under et angreb."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:349
msgid ""
"A payment from a session that never opened your checkout page gets a human "
"check."
msgstr ""
"En betaling fra en session, der aldrig åbnede din kasseside, får en "
"menneskekontrol."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:373
msgid "Why a check helps"
msgstr "Hvorfor en kontrol hjælper"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:373
msgid ""
"Limits slow a bot down. A human check stops it, because every attempt needs "
"a pass that bots can't produce in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Grænser bremser en bot. En menneskekontrol stopper den, fordi hvert forsøg "
"kræver en godkendelse, som bots ikke kan fremstille i store mængder."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:374
msgid "How shoppers see it"
msgstr "Sådan ser købere det"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:374
msgid ""
"Most people see a small box that ticks itself. A few are asked to click a "
"checkbox. It shows only above Place order, only when it's needed."
msgstr ""
"De fleste ser en lille boks, der afkrydser sig selv. Nogle få bliver bedt om "
"at klikke på en afkrydsningsboks. Den vises kun over Afgiv ordre, og kun når "
"der er brug for den."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:375
msgid "What if the check service is down?"
msgstr "Hvad hvis kontroltjenesten er nede?"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:375
msgid ""
"Payments are never blocked because a check provider is unavailable. They "
"carry on under stricter limits ( half the failed payments before a pause, "
"and a pause of at least an hour ), and this page tells you."
msgstr ""
"Betalinger blokeres aldrig, fordi en kontroludbyder ikke er tilgængelig. De "
"fortsætter under strengere grænser ( halvt så mange mislykkede betalinger "
"før en pause og en pause på mindst en time ), og denne side fortæller dig "
"det."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:379
#: admin/template/settings/account.php:174
msgid "Test your keys"
msgstr "Test dine nøgler"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:379
msgid ""
"Shows the check here, exactly as shoppers get it, and confirms your secret "
"key with the provider."
msgstr ""
"Viser kontrollen her, præcis som købere får den, og bekræfter din hemmelige "
"nøgle hos udbyderen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:379
msgid "Show a test check"
msgstr "Vis en testkontrol"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:420
msgid ""
"No reCAPTCHA keys yet. Add your reCAPTCHA v2 ( checkbox ) keys on Settings › "
"Accounts."
msgstr ""
"Ingen reCAPTCHA-nøgler endnu. Tilføj dine reCAPTCHA v2-nøgler "
"( afkrydsningsfelt ) under Indstillinger › Konti."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:420
msgid "Open Accounts"
msgstr "Åbn Konti"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:424
msgid "No Turnstile keys yet."
msgstr "Ingen Turnstile-nøgler endnu."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:424
msgid ""
"Protection still works without them: during an attack, payments that didn't "
"come from your checkout page are refused instead of checked. Keys make it "
"smoother for real shoppers. They are free:"
msgstr ""
"Beskyttelsen virker stadig uden dem: under et angreb afvises betalinger, der "
"ikke kom fra din kasseside, i stedet for at blive kontrolleret. Nøgler gør "
"det mere gnidningsfrit for rigtige købere. De er gratis:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:424
msgid "Open Cloudflare Turnstile"
msgstr "Åbn Cloudflare Turnstile"

#. translators: %s: the provider's error.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:429
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The check provider isn't working right now ( %s ). Payments carry on under "
"stricter limits until it answers again. If this doesn't clear in a few "
"minutes, check the secret key."
msgstr ""
"Kontroludbyderen virker ikke lige nu ( %s ). Betalinger fortsætter under "
"strengere grænser, indtil den svarer igen. Hvis det ikke forsvinder om et "
"par minutter, så tjek den hemmelige nøgle."

#. translators: %s: when the keys were tested.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:434
#, php-format
msgid "Keys work · tested %s"
msgstr "Nøglerne virker · testet %s"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:437
msgid "Keys saved but not tested yet. Use \"Show a test check\" below."
msgstr ""
"Nøglerne er gemt, men ikke testet endnu. Brug »Vis en testkontrol« nedenfor."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:445
msgid ""
"Change the declined, paused and human-check messages in the Language editor "
"( section Checkout Protection ), in every language your store uses."
msgstr ""
"Ret meddelelserne om afvist, pauset og menneskekontrol i Sprogeditoren "
"( afsnittet Checkout Protection ), på hvert sprog, din webshop bruger."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:445
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_documents.php:629
msgid "Edit wording"
msgstr "Rediger ordlyd"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:459
msgid ""
"Your network address can't be read on this server, so limits by address are "
"skipped and the other limits still apply."
msgstr ""
"Din netværksadresse kan ikke læses på denne server, så grænser pr. adresse "
"springes over, og de øvrige grænser gælder stadig."

#. translators: %s: address.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:464
#, php-format
msgid "Detected: through Cloudflare. Your address shows as %s."
msgstr "Registreret: via Cloudflare. Din adresse vises som %s."

#. translators: %s: address.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:467
#, php-format
msgid "Detected: through a proxy. Your address shows as %s."
msgstr "Registreret: via en proxy. Din adresse vises som %s."

#. translators: %s: address.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:470
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your address shows as %s, a private address. If every visitor shows the same "
"address, your host uses a proxy: choose Another proxy and list its address."
msgstr ""
"Din adresse vises som %s, en privat adresse. Hvis alle besøgende vises med "
"den samme adresse, bruger din udbyder en proxy: vælg Anden proxy, og angiv "
"dens adresse."

#. translators: %s: address.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:473
#, php-format
msgid "Detected: a direct connection. Your address shows as %s."
msgstr "Registreret: en direkte forbindelse. Din adresse vises som %s."

#. translators: %s: address.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:492
#, php-format
msgid "Your address right now: %s"
msgstr "Din adresse lige nu: %s"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:492
msgid "Add to never limit"
msgstr "Tilføj for aldrig at begrænse"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:495
msgid "Paused right now"
msgstr "Sat på pause lige nu"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:495
msgid ""
"These sources hit a limit. Pauses end by themselves; unpause someone who "
"contacts you."
msgstr ""
"Disse kilder nåede en grænse. Pauser ender af sig selv; ophæv pausen for en, "
"der kontakter dig."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:497
msgid "Nobody is paused."
msgstr "Ingen er sat på pause."

