msgstr "Ophæv pause"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:520
msgid ""
"Radar screens every payment automatically, and Stripe adds its own check "
"during attacks. In your Stripe dashboard, turn on the rule \"Block if CVC "
"verification fails\": it's free and stops most tests that guess a card's "
"security code. Make sure the EasyCart webhook is set up, so declines in the "
"payment form reach this page."
msgstr ""
"Radar screener automatisk hver betaling, og Stripe tilføjer sin egen kontrol "
"under angreb. Slå reglen »Block if CVC verification fails« til i dit Stripe-"
"dashboard: den er gratis og stopper de fleste test, der gætter et korts "
"sikkerhedskode. Sørg for, at EasyCart-webhooken er sat op, så afvisninger i "
"betalingsformularen når denne side."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:523
msgid ""
"Square screens online payments automatically. In your Square Dashboard, Risk "
"Manager can add a free rule to decline a card used more than 5 times in 24 "
"hours."
msgstr ""
"Square screener onlinebetalinger automatisk. I dit Square Dashboard kan Risk "
"Manager tilføje en gratis regel, der afviser et kort, som bruges mere end 5 "
"gange på 24 timer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:526
msgid ""
"PayPal screens payments on its side. If you take cards through PayPal's card "
"button, check the fraud filters in your PayPal business account."
msgstr ""
"PayPal screener betalinger på sin side. Hvis du tager imod kort via PayPals "
"kortknap, så tjek svindelfiltrene i din PayPal-erhvervskonto."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:529
msgid "Your gateway"
msgstr "Din gateway"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:529
msgid ""
"Most gateways offer fraud filters in their own dashboard. Turning on "
"security-code ( CVC ) and address checks there adds a second layer to the "
"protection here."
msgstr ""
"De fleste gateways tilbyder svindelfiltre i deres eget dashboard. Hvis du "
"slår sikkerhedskode- ( CVC ) og adressekontrol til dér, får beskyttelsen her "
"endnu et lag."

#. translators: %d: products.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:535
msgid "Your products"
msgstr "Dine produkter"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_checkout_protection.php:535
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d donation product has a minimum under 5. Bots love $1 donations: a minimum "
"of 5 or more makes your store a poor target."
msgid_plural ""
"%d donation products have a minimum under 5. Bots love $1 donations: a "
"minimum of 5 or more makes your store a poor target."
msgstr[0] ""
"%d donationsprodukt har et minimum under 5. Bots elsker donationer på $1: et "
"minimum på 5 eller mere gør din webshop til et dårligt mål."
msgstr[1] ""
"%d donationsprodukter har et minimum under 5. Bots elsker donationer på $1: "
"et minimum på 5 eller mere gør din webshop til et dårligt mål."

