"Nothing has been sent in the last 7 days, so there is no delivery rate yet. "
"Send yourself a test to check the setup."
msgstr ""
"Intet er blevet sendt inden for de sidste 7 dage, så der er ingen "
"leveringsrate endnu. Send dig selv en test for at kontrollere opsætningen."

