msgid ""
"Your mail server accepted every recent email. The delivery checks below help "
"those emails reach the inbox instead of spam."
msgstr ""
"Din mailserver accepterede alle nylige e-mails. Leveringstjekket nedenfor "
"hjælper disse e-mails med at nå indbakken i stedet for spam."

#. translators: %d: number of failed emails
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:169
#, php-format
