#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:276
#, php-format
msgid ""
"EasyCart sends as %1$s. If %2$s has a \"force from email\" setting turned "
"on, it replaces that address, so make sure the one it uses is on your own "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"EasyCart sender som %1$s. Hvis %2$s har en \"kraft fra e-mail \"-indstilling "
"slået til, erstatter den denne adresse, så sørg for, at den, den bruger, er "
"på dit eget domæne."

