msgstr "Sender du med %s?"

#. translators: 1: service name, 2: SPF include
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:371
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your SPF record does not mention %1$s. Many services only need their DKIM "
"records, but if their domain setup asks for SPF, edit your existing record "
"so it includes %2$s:"
msgstr ""
"Din SPF-record nævner ikke %1$s. Mange tjenester har kun brug for deres DKIM-"
"poster, men hvis deres domæneopsætning beder om SPF, skal du redigere din "
"eksisterende post, så den indeholder %2$s:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:375
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:434
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:455
msgid "Name / host"
msgstr "Navn/vært"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:379
msgid ""
"Edit the record you already have. A domain may only have one SPF record; a "
"second one breaks both."
msgstr ""
"Rediger den post, du allerede har. Et domæne må kun have én SPF-rekord; en "
"anden bryder begge."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:388
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Add this record to %s. It says your web server, your mail server and your "
"sending service may send email for the domain."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj denne post til %s. Der står, at din webserver, din mailserver og din "
"afsendelsestjeneste kan sende e-mail til domænet."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:393
#, php-format
msgid "Name / host (@ means %s)"
msgstr "Navn/vært (@betyder %s)"

#. translators: %s: service name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:399
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This already includes %s, which looks like the service sending your mail."
msgstr ""
"Dette omfatter allerede %s, som ligner den tjeneste, der sender din mail."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:407
msgid ""
"Send through a service or a hosted mailbox? Add its include just before "
"<code>~all</code>:"
msgstr ""
"Vil du sende via en tjeneste eller en hostet postkasse? Tilføj its include "
"lige før <code>~alle</code>:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:409
msgid ""
"Already have a TXT record starting with <code>v=spf1</code>? Edit that one "
"instead. A domain may only have one SPF record."
msgstr ""
"Har du allerede en TXT-record, der starter med <code>v=spf1</code>? Rediger "
"den i stedet. Et domæne må kun have én SPF-record."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:420
msgid ""
"DKIM records hold a unique key, so you copy them from whoever sends your "
"email rather than typing one yourself. Get it here:"
msgstr ""
"DKIM-poster har en unik nøgle, så du kopierer dem fra den, der sender din e-"
"mail, i stedet for selv at skrive en. Få den her:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:423
msgid "(looks like yours):"
msgstr "(ligner din):"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:425
msgid "Email with your web host (cPanel):"
msgstr "E-mail med din webhost (cPanel):"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:425
msgid ""
"Email › Email Deliverability › Manage next to your domain. If your DNS is at "
"the same host, press \"Install the suggested record\"."
msgstr ""
"E-mail › E-maillevering › Administrer ved siden af dit domæne. Hvis din DNS "
"er hos samme vært, skal du trykke på \"Installer den foreslåede post\"."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:426
msgid "Add the record, wait an hour, then press \"Start authentication\"."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj posten, vent en time, og tryk derefter på \"Start godkendelse\"."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:427
msgid "Add the two CNAME records it shows, then turn signing on."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj de to CNAME-poster, der vises, og tænd derefter for at logge på."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:428
msgid "Sending services (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES, Postmark):"
msgstr ""
"Afsendelsestjenester (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon ses, Poststempel):"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:428
msgid ""
"look for \"Domain authentication\" or \"Verify domain\". They list two or "
"three records to add."
msgstr ""
"kigge efter \"Domænegodkendelse\" eller \"Bekræft domæne\". De viser to "
"eller tre poster, der skal tilføjes."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:430
msgid "The record you add looks like this:"
msgstr "Den post, du tilføjer, ser sådan ud:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:433
msgid "TXT or CNAME (as given)"
msgstr "TXT eller CNAME (som angivet)"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:435
msgid "the long text from your provider"
msgstr "den lange tekst fra din udbyder"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:438
msgid ""
"We look for common selector names (default, google, selector1, k1, s1…). If "
"your provider uses a different name, DKIM may already work even though this "
"still shows a warning."
msgstr ""
"Vi leder efter almindelige vælgernavne (standard, google, selector1, k1, "
"s1...). Hvis din udbyder bruger et andet navn, kan DKIM allerede fungere, "
"selvom dette stadig viser en advarsel."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:451
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Add this record to %s. It only watches: it never blocks your mail, and it "
"sends you reports on who is sending as your domain."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj denne post til %s. Det overvåger kun: det blokerer aldrig din mail, "
"og det sender dig rapporter om, hvem der sender som dit domæne."

#. translators: 1: full record name, 2: report address
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:460
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Some DNS hosts want the full name, %1$s. Reports go to %2$s; change it to "
"any mailbox you read."
msgstr ""
"Nogle DNS-værter vil have det fulde navn, %1$s. Rapporter går til %2$s; ændr "
"det til enhver postkasse, du læser."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:461
msgid ""
"Set up SPF and DKIM first. After a few weeks of clean reports you can change "
"<code>p=none</code> to <code>p=quarantine</code> for extra protection."
msgstr ""
"Opsæt SPF og DKIM først. Efter et par uger med rene rapporter kan du ændre "
"<code>p=ingen</code> til <code>p=karantæne</code> for ekstra beskyttelse."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:468
msgid "How to check another way"
msgstr "Sådan tjekker du på en anden måde"

#. translators: %s: link to Google Admin Toolbox
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:473
#, php-format
msgid "Open %s, enter your domain and read the SPF, DKIM and DMARC results."
msgstr "Åbn %s, indtast dit domæne og læs SPF-, DKIM- og DMARC-resultaterne."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:473
msgid "Google Admin Toolbox Check MX"
msgstr "Google Admin Toolbox Check MX"

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:475
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Or ask your host: \"Please confirm SPF, DKIM and DMARC are set up for %s.\""
msgstr ""
"Eller spørg din vært: \"Bekræft, at SPF, DKIM og DMARC er konfigureret til "
"%s.\""

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:487
msgid ""
"Ask your host whether outgoing SMTP is allowed, and on which port (587 is "
"the usual one)."
msgstr ""
"Spørg din vært, om udgående SMTP er tilladt, og på hvilken port (587 er den "
"sædvanlige)."

#. translators: %s: link to the Send method setting
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:489
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Or avoid the blocked port: set %s to WordPress mail and use a mail plugin "
"that connects over an API (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES, Postmark). "
"APIs use the normal web port, which hosts do not block."
msgstr ""
"Eller undgå den blokerede port: indstil %s til WordPress mail og brug et "
"mail-plugin, der forbinder via en API (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon ses, "
"Postmark). API'er bruger den normale webport, som værter ikke blokerer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:489
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:580
msgid "Send method"
msgstr "Afsendelsesmetode:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:503
msgid ""
"Sign up for a sending service built for store email (Brevo, SendGrid, "
"Mailgun, Amazon SES or Postmark). Most have a free or low-cost plan."
msgstr ""
"Tilmeld dig en afsendelsestjeneste, der er bygget til butiks-e-mail (Brevo, "
"SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon ses eller Poststempel). De fleste har et gratis "
"eller billigt abonnement."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:504
msgid ""
"Verify your domain with them: they give you DNS records that also take care "
"of SPF and DKIM."
msgstr ""
"Bekræft dit domæne med dem: De giver dig DNS-poster, der også tager sig af "
"SPF og DKIM."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:505
msgid ""
"Paste their API key into your mail plugin, choosing that service instead of "
"Gmail, and send a test."
msgstr ""
"Indsæt deres API-nøgle i dit e-mail-plugin, vælg den pågældende tjeneste i "
"stedet for Gmail, og send en test."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:581
msgid "cPanel › Domains › Zone Editor › Manage › Add Record"
msgstr "cPanel › Domæner › Zoneditor › Administrer › Tilføj post"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:583
msgid ""
"Cloudflare dashboard › your domain › DNS › Records › Add record. Leave "
"\"Proxy\" off for email records."
msgstr ""
"Cloudflare-dashboard › dit domæne › DNS › Optegnelser › Tilføj optegnelse. "
"Lad \"Proxy\" være slået fra for e-mailoptegnelser."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:584
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:585
msgid "GoDaddy › My Products › your domain › DNS › Add New Record"
msgstr "GoDaddy › Mine produkter › dit domæne › DNS › Tilføj ny post"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:586
msgid "Namecheap › Domain List › Manage › Advanced DNS › Add New Record"
msgstr "Namecheap › Domæneliste › Administrer › Avanceret DNS › Tilføj ny post"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:587
msgid "SiteGround Site Tools › Domain › DNS Zone Editor"
msgstr "SiteGround Webstedsværktøjer › Domæne › DNS-zoneeditor"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:590
msgid "Bluehost › Domains › your domain › DNS"
msgstr "Bluehost › Domæner › dit domæne › DNS"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:593
msgid "Hostinger hPanel › Domains › your domain › DNS / Nameservers"
msgstr "Hostinger hPanel › Domæner › dit domæne › DNS/navneservere"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:594
msgid "AWS console › Route 53 › Hosted zones › your domain › Create record"
msgstr "AWS-konsol › Rute 53 › Hostede zoner › dit domæne › Opret post"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:596
msgid "IONOS › Domains & SSL › your domain › DNS › Add record"
msgstr "IONOS › Domæner og SSL › dit domæne › DNS › Tilføj post"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:597
msgid "WordPress.com › Upgrades › Domains › your domain › DNS records"
msgstr "WordPress.com › Opgraderinger › Domæner › dit domæne › DNS-poster"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:598
msgid "Wix › Domains › your domain › Manage DNS records"
msgstr "Wix › Domæner › dit domæne › Administrer DNS-poster"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:599
msgid "DigitalOcean › Networking › Domains › your domain"
msgstr "DigitalOcean › Netværk › Domæner › dit domæne"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:623
msgid "Where to add it"
msgstr "Sådan tilføjer du det"

#. translators: 1: DNS provider name, 2: nameserver
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:627
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The DNS for this domain looks like it is managed at %1$s (nameserver %2$s)."
msgstr ""
"DNS'en for dette domæne ser ud til at blive administreret på %1$s "
"(navneserver %2$s)."

#. translators: 1: domain, 2: nameserver
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:630
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The DNS for %1$s is run by the company behind its nameserver, %2$s. That is "
"usually your web host or where you bought the domain; log in there and look "
"for DNS, Zone Editor or Advanced DNS."
msgstr ""
"DNS'en for %1$s drives af virksomheden bag dens navneserver, %2$s. Det er "
"normalt din webhost, eller hvor du købte domænet. Log ind der, og kig efter "
"DNS, Zone Editor eller Advanced DNS."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:633
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In the DNS settings for %s: usually where you bought the domain, or your web "
"host if the domain points there."
msgstr ""
"I DNS-indstillingerne for %s: Normalt hvor du købte domænet, eller din "
"webhost, hvis domænet peger derhen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:636
msgid "DNS › Records › Add record"
msgstr "DNS › Optegnelser › Tilføj optegnelse"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:637
msgid "Domains › Zone Editor › Manage › Add Record"
msgstr "Domæner › Zoneditor › Administrer › Tilføj post"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:638
msgid "My Products › DNS › Add New Record"
msgstr "Mine produkter › DNS › Tilføj ny post"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:639
msgid "Domain List › Manage › Advanced DNS"
msgstr "Domæneliste › Administrer › Avanceret DNS"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:641
msgid ""
"New records usually show up within an hour (occasionally up to 48 hours). "
"Then run the checks again."
msgstr ""
"Nye optegnelser dukker normalt op inden for en time (nogle gange op til 48 "
"timer). Kør derefter kontrollerne igen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:674
msgid "Installed, not turned on"
msgstr "Installeret, ikke tændt"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:674
msgid "To do"
msgstr "Ikke startet"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:677
msgid "Improve delivery in 3 steps"
msgstr "Forbedr leveringen i 3 trin"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:677
msgid "About 15 minutes · free"
msgstr "Ca. 15 minutter · gratis"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:678
msgid ""
"Right now your store emails leave through your web server's basic mail, "
"which inboxes often send to spam. A free mail plugin connects your store to "
"a real mailbox or sending service so receipts, order updates and password "
"emails arrive."
msgstr ""
"Lige nu forlader dine butiksmails via din webservers grundlæggende mail, som "
"indbakker ofte sender til spam. Et gratis mail-plugin forbinder din butik "
"til en rigtig postkasse eller afsendelsestjeneste, så kvitteringer, "
"ordreopdateringer og adgangskode-e-mails ankommer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:683
msgid "Install a free mail plugin"
msgstr "Installer et gratis mail-plugin"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:684
msgid ""
"We suggest WP Mail SMTP or FluentSMTP. Both are free, widely used, and have "
"a setup wizard that asks simple questions."
msgstr ""
"Vi foreslår WP Mail SMTP eller FluentSMTP. Begge er gratis, meget udbredte "
"og har en opsætningsguide, der stiller enkle spørgsmål."

#. translators: %s: plugin name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:689
#, php-format
msgid "Turn on %s"
msgstr "Slå til %s"

#. translators: %s: plugin name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:699
#, php-format
msgid "Find %s"
msgstr "Find %s"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:703
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:734
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:782
msgid "Show me how"
msgstr "Vis mig hvordan."

#. translators: %s: plugin name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:708
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Press <b>Turn on %s</b>. It opens the Plugins page filtered to that plugin."
msgstr ""
"Tryk <b>på Tænd %s</b>. Den åbner siden Plugins, der er filtreret til det "
"pågældende plugin."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:709
msgid "Press <b>Activate</b> under the plugin name."
msgstr "Tryk på <b>Aktiver</b> under plugin-navnet."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:710
msgid ""
"The plugin opens its setup wizard or settings. Keep this page open in "
"another tab so you can come back."
msgstr ""
"Plugin'et åbner sin opsætningsguide eller indstillinger. Hold denne side "
"åben i en anden fane, så du kan komme tilbage."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:714
msgid ""
"Press <b>Find WP Mail SMTP</b> (or FluentSMTP). It opens Plugins › Add New "
"with the search filled in."
msgstr ""
"Tryk på <b>Find WP Mail SMTP</b> (eller FluentSMTP). Den åbner Plugins › "
"Tilføj ny med søgningen udfyldt."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:715
msgid ""
"Press <b>Install Now</b> on the plugin card, wait a moment, then press "
"<b>Activate</b>."
msgstr ""
"Tryk på <b>Installer nu</b> på plugin-kortet, vent et øjeblik, og tryk "
"derefter på <b>Aktiver</b>."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:716
msgid ""
"The plugin opens its setup wizard. Keep this page open in another tab so you "
"can come back."
msgstr ""
"Plugin åbner sin opsætningsguide. Hold denne side åben i en anden fane, så "
"du kan komme tilbage."

#. translators: %s: link to the Send method setting
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:721
#, php-format
msgid ""
"EasyCart is set to its built-in mailer, which skips mail plugins. Set %s to "
"WordPress mail."
msgstr ""
"EasyCart er indstillet til sin indbyggede mailer, som springer mail-plugins "
"over. Indstil %s til WordPress-mail."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:725
msgid ""
"Your account cannot install plugins. Ask whoever manages this site to "
"install WP Mail SMTP or FluentSMTP."
msgstr ""
"Din konto kan ikke installere plugins. Bed den, der administrerer dette "
"websted, om at installere WP Mail SMTP eller FluentSMTP."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:731
msgid "Connect it to your email"
msgstr "Forbind den til din e-mail"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:731
msgid "After step 1"
msgstr "Efter trin 1"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:732
msgid ""
"The plugin needs an account to send from. Use the mailbox you already have, "
"or a sending service if your store sends a lot."
msgstr ""
"Pluginet skal have en konto at sende fra. Brug den postkasse, du allerede "
"har, eller en afsendelsestjeneste, hvis din butik sender meget."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:738
msgid "Email with your web host (cPanel)"
msgstr "E-mail med din webhost (cPanel)"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:739
msgid "In the plugin choose <b>Other SMTP</b> and enter:"
msgstr "I plugin'et skal du vælge <b>Andet SMTP</b> og indtaste:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:742
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:735
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:1047
msgid "SMTP host"
msgstr "SMTP-vært"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:743
msgid "Port and encryption"
msgstr "Port og kryptering"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:743
msgid "465 with SSL, or 587 with TLS"
msgstr "465 med SSL eller 587 med TLS"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:744
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Brugernavn"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:744
msgid "your full email address"
msgstr "Din mailadresse"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:745
msgid "that mailbox's password"
msgstr "den pågældende postkasses adgangskode"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:748
msgid "Exact values are in cPanel › Email › Email Accounts › Connect Devices."
msgstr ""
"De nøjagtige værdier er angivet i cPanel › E-mail › E-mailkonti › Tilslut "
"enheder."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:751
msgid "Google Workspace or Gmail"
msgstr "Google Workspace eller Gmail"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:752
msgid ""
"Choose the plugin's <b>Google / Gmail</b> option and sign in with Google. "
"Gmail limits how many emails you can send a day, so busy stores should use a "
"sending service."
msgstr ""
"Vælg plugin'ets Google/Gmail-indstilling<b>,</b> og log ind med Google. "
"Gmail begrænser, hvor mange e-mails du kan sende om dagen, så travle "
"udbydere bør bruge en afsendelsestjeneste."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:755
msgid "Microsoft 365 or Outlook"
msgstr "Microsoft 365 eller Outlook"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:756
msgid ""
"Choose the plugin's <b>Microsoft / Outlook</b> option and sign in with "
"Microsoft. Microsoft is turning off password-only SMTP, so the sign-in "
"option is the one that keeps working."
msgstr ""
"Vælg plugin'ets Microsoft/Outlook-indstilling<b>,</b> og log ind med "
"Microsoft. Microsoft deaktiverer SMTP kun med adgangskode, så "
"logonindstillingen er den, der fortsætter med at fungere."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:759
msgid "A sending service (most reliable)"
msgstr "En afsendelsestjeneste (mest pålidelig)"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:760
msgid ""
"Sign up with Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES or Postmark. Verify your "
"domain (they give you DNS records, which also fixes SPF and DKIM), create an "
"API key, pick that service in the plugin and paste the key."
msgstr ""
"Tilmeld dig med Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon ses eller Poststempel. "
"Bekræft dit domæne (de giver dig DNS-poster, som også retter SPF og DKIM), "
"opret en API-nøgle, vælg den pågældende tjeneste i plugin'et og indsæt "
"nøglen."

#. translators: %s: from address
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:766
#, php-format
msgid "Whichever you choose, send from the same address EasyCart uses: %s."
msgstr ""
"Uanset hvad du vælger, skal du sende fra den samme adresse, som EasyCart "
"bruger: %s."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:773
msgid "Send a test, then run the checks again"
msgstr "Send en test, og kør derefter kontrollerne igen"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:773
msgid "After step 2"
msgstr "Efter trin 2"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:774
msgid ""
