#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:170
msgid ""
"Connects your store to ShipStation: paid orders go in, shipments and "
"tracking come back. Labels, rates at checkout and stock too."
msgstr ""
"Forbinder din butik med ShipStation: betalte ordrer sendes ind, forsendelser "
"og sporing kommer tilbage. Etiketter, priser i kassen og lager også."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:171
msgid "Ship every order through ShipStation"
msgstr "Send alle ordrer via ShipStation"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:178
msgid ""
"Its settings went missing in WP EasyCart 6.0.0, and ShipStation API keys now "
"expire every few months, which stops orders reaching ShipStation. Version "
"2.1 brings the settings back and connects ShipStation as a store with "
"nothing to expire. Orders keep going to ShipStation until you update."
msgstr ""
"Dens indstillinger forsvandt i WP EasyCart 6.0.0, og ShipStation API-nøgler "
"udløber nu hvert par måneder, hvilket stopper ordrer i at nå frem til "
"ShipStation. Version 2.1 bringer indstillingerne tilbage og forbinder "
"ShipStation som en butik, hvor intet udløber. Ordrer bliver ved med at gå "
"til ShipStation, indtil du opdaterer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:180
msgid "Orders flow in on their own"
msgstr "Ordrer kommer ind af sig selv"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:180
msgid ""
"ShipStation reads paid orders from your store, and edits and cancellations "
"follow."
msgstr ""
"ShipStation henter betalte ordrer fra din butik, og ændringer og "
"annulleringer følger med."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:181
msgid "Every shipment comes back"
msgstr "Hver forsendelse kommer retur"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:181
msgid ""
"Each shipment lands on the order with its items and tracking number, and the "
"customer gets the shipped email."
msgstr ""
"Hver forsendelse lander på ordren med sine varer og sporingsnummer, og "
"kunden får afsendelses-e-mailen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:182
msgid "Labels and rates in EasyCart"
msgstr "Etiketter og priser i EasyCart"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:182
msgid ""
"Buy ShipStation labels from the order screen and show its rates at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Køb ShipStation-etiketter fra ordreskærmen og vis dens priser i kassen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:183
msgid "Monthly boxes"
msgstr "Månedlige æsker"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:183
msgid "Subscriptions paid ahead ship a box every month."
msgstr "Abonnementer, der er betalt forud, sender en æske hver måned."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:189
msgid ""
"Buys USPS, UPS, FedEx and DHL Express labels with your Stamps.com account "
"from the order screen, one order or many, and brings tracking back to every "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Køber USPS-, UPS-, FedEx- og DHL Express-etiketter med din Stamps.com-konto "
"fra ordreskærmen, én ordre eller mange, og bringer sporing tilbage til hver "
"ordre."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:190
msgid "Print labels from your Stamps.com account on the order screen"
msgstr "Udskriv etiketter fra din Stamps.com-konto på ordreskærmen"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:199
msgid "Every carrier on your account"
msgstr "Alle transportører på din konto"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:199
msgid ""
"Compare USPS, UPS, FedEx and DHL Express rates and print the label right on "
"the order."
msgstr ""
"Sammenlign priser fra USPS, UPS, FedEx og DHL Express, og udskriv etiketten "
"direkte på ordren."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:200
msgid "Many orders at once"
msgstr "Mange ordrer på én gang"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:200
msgid ""
"Buy labels for a batch of orders, print them on one page and make the day's "
"SCAN form."
msgstr ""
"Køb etiketter til en række ordrer, udskriv dem på én side, og opret dagens "
"SCAN-formular."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:201
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:217
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:258
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:277
msgid "Tracking comes back"
msgstr "Sporing kommer tilbage"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:201
msgid ""
"Tracking lands on the order and in the shipped email, and follows the "
"package until it is delivered."
msgstr ""
"Sporing lander på ordren og i afsendelses-e-mailen og følger pakken, indtil "
"den er leveret."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:202
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_setup_wizard.php:2942
msgid "Returns and refunds"
msgstr "RETURNERING OG REFUNDERING"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:202
msgid "Email a return label, void a label for a refund, or reprint it."
msgstr ""
"Send en returetiket pr. e-mail, annuller en etiket for at få refusion, eller "
"udskriv den igen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:208
msgid ""
"Buys and prints labels for USPS, UPS, FedEx, DHL and more from the order "
"screen, brings tracking and delivery back to the order, and shows Shippo "
"rates at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Køber og udskriver etiketter til USPS, UPS, FedEx, DHL og flere fra "
"ordreskærmen, bringer sporing og levering tilbage til ordren og viser Shippo-"
"priser i kassen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:209
msgid "Print labels for every carrier from the order screen"
msgstr "Udskriv etiketter til alle transportører fra ordreskærmen"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:216
msgid "Labels on the order"
msgstr "Etiketter på ordren"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:216
msgid ""
"Compare carrier rates, then buy and print the label without leaving "
"EasyCart, one order or many."
msgstr ""
"Sammenlign transportørernes priser, køb og udskriv derefter etiketten uden "
"at forlade EasyCart, for én ordre eller mange."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:217
msgid ""
"Tracking and delivery update the order, even for labels bought in Shippo."
msgstr ""
"Sporing og levering opdaterer ordren, også for etiketter købt i Shippo."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:218
msgid "Rates at checkout"
msgstr "Priser i kassen"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:218
msgid "Offer the Shippo services you choose as shipping options."
msgstr "Tilbyd de Shippo-tjenester, du vælger, som forsendelsesmuligheder."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:224
msgid ""
"Shows DHL Express rates from your Optimal Logistics account at checkout, "
"with your markup, insurance and delivery days."
msgstr ""
"Viser DHL Express-priser fra din Optimal Logistics-konto i kassen, med din "
"avance, forsikring og leveringsdage."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:225
msgid "Offer DHL Express at your OptimalShip rates"
msgstr "Tilbyd DHL Express til dine OptimalShip-priser"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:233
msgid ""
"Version 2.0 moves its settings into EasyCart, keeps checkout working when "
"OptimalShip is slow, and quotes in the units DHL expects. DHL keeps showing "
"at checkout until you update."
msgstr ""
"Version 2.0 flytter indstillingerne ind i EasyCart, holder kassen i gang, "
"når OptimalShip er langsom, og angiver priser i de enheder, DHL forventer. "
"DHL bliver ved med at blive vist i kassen, indtil du opdaterer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:235
msgid "DHL Express at checkout"
msgstr "DHL Express i kassen"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:235
msgid ""
"Priced live by OptimalShip from the cart's boxes and destination, with "
"delivery days."
msgstr ""
"Prissat live af OptimalShip ud fra kurvens æsker og destination, med "
"leveringsdage."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:236
msgid "Your pricing"
msgstr "Din prissætning"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:236
msgid ""
"Add your markup, insure shipments, offer free DHL over an amount and choose "
"the countries."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj din avance, forsikr forsendelser, tilbyd gratis DHL over et beløb, og "
"vælg landene."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:237
msgid "Your account"
msgstr "Din konto"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:237
msgid "Uses the DHL rates on your own Optimal Logistics account."
msgstr "Bruger DHL-priserne på din egen Optimal Logistics-konto."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:245
msgid ""
"Sells Printful's print-on-demand products in your store: import them with "
"their colors, sizes and mockups, show Printful shipping at checkout, send "
"paid orders to Printful and bring tracking back."
msgstr ""
"Sælger Printfuls print on demand-produkter i din butik: importér dem med "
"deres farver, størrelser og mockups, vis Printful-forsendelse i kassen, send "
"betalte ordrer til Printful og få sporing tilbage."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:246
msgid "Sell print-on-demand products made and shipped by Printful"
msgstr "Sælg print on demand-produkter, der fremstilles og sendes af Printful"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:255
msgid "Your Printful products, in your store"
msgstr "Dine Printful-produkter i din butik"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:255
msgid ""
"Import what you design in Printful with its colors, sizes, mockups and your "
"prices."
msgstr ""
"Importér det, du designer i Printful, med farver, størrelser, mockups og "
"dine priser."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:256
msgid "Orders go to Printful"
msgstr "Ordrer sendes til Printful"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:256
msgid ""
"Paid orders reach Printful on their own, after a delay you choose or as "
"drafts you confirm."
msgstr ""
"Betalte ordrer når Printful af sig selv, efter en forsinkelse, du vælger, "
"eller som kladder, du bekræfter."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:257
msgid "Printful shipping at checkout"
msgstr "Printful-forsendelse i kassen"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:257
msgid ""
"Printful's rates and delivery times, even when the cart also holds products "
"you ship yourself."
msgstr ""
"Printfuls priser og leveringstider, også når kurven indeholder produkter, du "
"selv sender."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:258
msgid ""
"Each Printful package lands on the order with its tracking, and the customer "
"gets the shipped email."
msgstr ""
"Hver Printful-pakke lander på ordren med sin sporing, og kunden får "
"afsendelses-e-mailen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:264
msgid ""
"Sells Printify's print-on-demand products in your store: publish or import "
"them with their variants and mockups, show Printify shipping at checkout, "
"send paid orders to Printify and bring tracking back."
msgstr ""
"Sælger Printifys print on demand-produkter i din butik: udgiv eller importér "
"dem med deres varianter og mockups, vis Printify-forsendelse i kassen, send "
"betalte ordrer til Printify og få sporing tilbage."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:265
msgid "Sell print-on-demand products made by Printify's print providers"
msgstr ""
"Sælg print on demand-produkter, der er fremstillet af Printifys trykudbydere"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:274
msgid "Publish from Printify"
msgstr "Udgiv fra Printify"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:274
msgid ""
"Products you publish in Printify arrive in your store with their variants, "
"mockups and prices."
msgstr ""
"Produkter, du udgiver i Printify, kommer til din butik med deres varianter, "
"mockups og priser."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:275
msgid "Orders go to Printify"
msgstr "Ordrer sendes til Printify"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:275
msgid "Paid orders reach Printify on their own, after a hold you choose."
msgstr "Betalte ordrer når Printify af sig selv, efter en ventetid, du vælger."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:276
msgid "Printify shipping at checkout"
msgstr "Printify-forsendelse i kassen"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:276
msgid ""
"Printify's shipping for its items, even when the cart also holds products "
"you ship yourself."
msgstr ""
"Printifys forsendelse af dets varer, også når kurven indeholder produkter, "
"du selv sender."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:277
msgid ""
"Each package lands on the order with its tracking, and the customer gets the "
"shipped email."
msgstr ""
"Hver pakke lander på ordren med sin sporing, og kunden får afsendelses-e-"
"mailen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:283
msgid ""
"Calculates sales tax at checkout with Avalara and records every order in "
"Avalara for your returns."
msgstr ""
"Beregner salgsafgift i kassen med Avalara og registrerer hver ordre i "
"Avalara til dine selvangivelser."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:284
msgid "Let Avalara calculate and record your sales tax"
msgstr "Lad Avalara beregne og registrere din salgsafgift"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:291
msgid "Tax at checkout"
msgstr "Skat i kassen"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:291
msgid "For the exact cart, address and customer, from Avalara."
msgstr "Til den præcise kurv, adresse og kunde, fra Avalara."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:292
msgid "Ready to file"
msgstr "Klar til indberetning"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:292
msgid ""
"Orders are recorded, committed, voided and refunded in Avalara as they "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Ordrer registreres, bogføres, annulleres og refunderes i Avalara, "
"efterhånden som de ændres."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:293
msgid "Backup rates"
msgstr "Reservesatser"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:293
msgid "Checkout keeps working if Avalara can't be reached."
msgstr "Kassen fortsætter med at virke, hvis Avalara ikke kan kontaktes."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:299
msgid ""
"Syncs orders, customers and products with QuickBooks Desktop through the "
"QuickBooks Web Connector."
msgstr ""
"Synkroniserer ordrer, kunder og produkter med QuickBooks Desktop via "
"QuickBooks Web Connector."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:300
msgid "Keep QuickBooks Desktop in step with your store"
msgstr "Hold QuickBooks Desktop synkroniseret med din butik"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:309
msgid ""
"Version 2.1 moves its settings to EasyCart › Extensions › QuickBooks "
"Desktop, shows what reached QuickBooks and what it refused, sends tips, Flex-"
"Fees and how each order was paid, and fixes new products, refunds, VAT, duty "
"and Canadian taxes that did not reach QuickBooks correctly. Orders keep "
"going to QuickBooks until you update."
msgstr ""
"Version 2.1 flytter indstillingerne til EasyCart › Udvidelser › QuickBooks "
"Desktop, viser, hvad der nåede frem til QuickBooks, og hvad det afviste, "
"sender drikkepenge, Flex-Fees og hvordan hver ordre blev betalt, og retter "
"nye produkter, refusioner, moms, told og canadiske skatter, der ikke nåede "
"korrekt frem til QuickBooks. Ordrer bliver ved med at gå til QuickBooks, "
"indtil du opdaterer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:311
msgid "Orders in QuickBooks"
msgstr "Ordrer i QuickBooks"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:311
msgid "The Web Connector adds each order to QuickBooks Desktop."
msgstr "Web Connector tilføjer hver ordre til QuickBooks Desktop."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:312
msgid "Customers and products"
msgstr "Kunder og produkter"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:312
msgid "Matched to your QuickBooks lists."
msgstr "Matches med dine QuickBooks-lister."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:313
msgid "On a schedule"
msgstr "Efter en tidsplan"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:313
msgid "No exports and no retyping."
msgstr "Ingen eksporter og ingen genindtastning."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:320
msgid ""
"Sends each order to Xero as an invoice with your store's tax, and records "
"its payments. Refunds become credit notes, and an invoice paid in Xero marks "
"the order paid."
msgstr ""
"Sender hver ordre til Xero som en faktura med din webshops moms og "
"registrerer dens betalinger. Refusioner bliver til kreditnotaer, og en "
"faktura, der er betalt i Xero, markerer ordren som betalt."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:321
msgid "Send every order to Xero"
msgstr "Send hver ordre til Xero"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:329
msgid "Orders become invoices"
msgstr "Ordrer bliver til fakturaer"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:329
msgid ""
"Each order goes to Xero as an invoice with its customer and the tax your "
"store charged."
msgstr ""
"Hver ordre sendes til Xero som en faktura med kunden og den moms, din "
"webshop har opkrævet."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:330
msgid "Payments and refunds"
msgstr "Betalinger og refusioner"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:330
msgid "Payments are recorded on the invoice, and refunds become credit notes."
msgstr ""
"Betalinger registreres på fakturaen, og refusioner bliver til kreditnotaer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:331
msgid "Paid in Xero, paid here"
msgstr "Betalt i Xero, betalt her"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:331
msgid "When an invoice is paid in Xero, the order is marked paid."
msgstr "Når en faktura betales i Xero, markeres ordren som betalt."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:337
msgid ""
"Sends each paid order to QuickBooks Online as a sales receipt ( an unpaid "
"one as an invoice ), with your products as items and your store's own tax "
"amount. Refunds become refund receipts, and invoices paid in QuickBooks and "
"stock counts come back."
msgstr ""
"Sender hver betalt ordre til QuickBooks Online som en salgskvittering ( en "
"ubetalt som en faktura ), med dine produkter som varer og din webshops eget "
"momsbeløb. Refusioner bliver til refusionskvitteringer, og fakturaer betalt "
"i QuickBooks samt lagerbeholdninger kommer tilbage."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:338
msgid "Keep QuickBooks Online in step with your store"
msgstr "Hold QuickBooks Online synkroniseret med din webshop"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:346
msgid "Orders in QuickBooks Online"
msgstr "Ordrer i QuickBooks Online"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:346
msgid ""
"A paid order becomes a sales receipt and an unpaid one an invoice, with the "
"tax your store charged."
msgstr ""
"En betalt ordre bliver til en salgskvittering og en ubetalt til en faktura, "
"med den moms, din webshop har opkrævet."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:347
msgid "Products and refunds"
msgstr "Produkter og refusioner"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:347
msgid ""
"Your products become QuickBooks items, and refunds become refund receipts."
msgstr ""
"Dine produkter bliver til QuickBooks-varer, og refusioner bliver til "
"refusionskvitteringer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:348
msgid "Payments and stock come back"
msgstr "Betalinger og lager kommer tilbage"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:348
msgid ""
"An invoice paid in QuickBooks marks the order paid, and stock counts follow "
"QuickBooks."
msgstr ""
"En faktura, der er betalt i QuickBooks, markerer ordren som betalt, og "
"lagerbeholdningen følger QuickBooks."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:354
msgid "Keeps a product feed for your Facebook and Instagram catalog."
msgstr "Vedligeholder et produktfeed til dit Facebook- og Instagram-katalog."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:362
msgid "Product feed"
msgstr "Produktfeed"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:362
msgid "Your products, prices and stock in Meta's catalog format."
msgstr "Dine produkter, priser og lager i Metas katalogformat."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:363
msgid "Always current"
msgstr "Altid opdateret"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:363
msgid "The feed follows your products as they change."
msgstr "Feedet følger dine produkter, efterhånden som de ændrer sig."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:364
msgid "Purchases reported"
msgstr "Køb rapporteret"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:364
msgid "Orders are sent to Meta from your server."
msgstr "Ordrer sendes til Meta fra din server."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:368
#: admin/template/products/products/product-details-v2.php:464
msgid "Email Marketing"
msgstr "E-mailmarketing"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:370
msgid ""
"Connects your store to Mailchimp or Klaviyo: customers, orders, products and "
"abandoned carts go to your email marketing, so you can send cart reminders, "
"product recommendations and campaigns by what people bought. Newsletter sign-"
"ups stay in step both ways."
msgstr ""
"Forbinder din webshop med Mailchimp eller Klaviyo: kunder, ordrer, produkter "
"og forladte kurve sendes til din e-mailmarketing, så du kan sende "
"kurvpåmindelser, produktanbefalinger og kampagner ud fra, hvad folk har "
"købt. Tilmeldinger til nyhedsbrevet holdes synkroniseret begge veje."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:371
msgid "Email that knows what your customers bought"
msgstr "E-mail, der ved, hvad dine kunder har købt"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:379
msgid "Abandoned cart emails"
msgstr "E-mails om forladte kurve"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:379
msgid ""
"Carts left behind reach Mailchimp or Klaviyo with their items and a link "
"back, so its automations can bring the customer back."
msgstr ""
"Efterladte kurve når frem til Mailchimp eller Klaviyo med deres varer og et "
"link tilbage, så automatiseringerne kan få kunden tilbage."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:380
msgid "Product recommendations"
msgstr "Produktanbefalinger"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:380
msgid ""
"Your products and orders go to Mailchimp or Klaviyo, so emails can suggest "
"what each customer may buy next."
msgstr ""
"Dine produkter og ordrer sendes til Mailchimp eller Klaviyo, så e-mails kan "
"foreslå, hvad hver kunde måske vil købe næste gang."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:381
msgid "Segments by what people bought"
msgstr "Segmenter efter, hvad folk har købt"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:381
msgid ""
"Target customers by product, spend or last order. Sign-ups and unsubscribes "
"stay in step both ways."
msgstr ""
"Målret kunder efter produkt, forbrug eller seneste ordre. Tilmeldinger og "
"afmeldinger holdes synkroniseret begge veje."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:387
msgid "Sends store email through Mailchimp Transactional ( Mandrill )."
msgstr "Sender webshoppens e-mails via Mailchimp Transactional ( Mandrill )."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:397
msgid ""
"Runs Groupon and Wowcher deals in your store: imports their voucher codes, "
"honors what buyers paid after a deal ends, and lists redeemed codes to "
"report."
msgstr ""
"Kører Groupon- og Wowcher-deals i din webshop: importerer deres "
"voucherkoder, respekterer det, køberne har betalt, når en deal udløber, og "
"viser indløste koder til rapportering."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:398
msgid "Sell a Groupon or Wowcher deal through your store"
msgstr "Sælg en Groupon- eller Wowcher-deal via din webshop"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:405
msgid ""
"Version 1 saves every code file you upload in its plugin folder, and "
"importing a file again makes used vouchers work again. Version 2 keeps deal "
"codes with your offers, brings your earlier imports over with their use "
"counts, and never stores the files."
msgstr ""
"Version 1 gemmer hver kodefil, du uploader, i sin plugin-mappe, og hvis du "
"importerer en fil igen, virker brugte vouchers igen. Version 2 opbevarer "
"dealkoder sammen med dine tilbud, overfører dine tidligere importer med "
"deres brugstal og gemmer aldrig filerne."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:407
msgid "Import deal codes"
msgstr "Importer dealkoder"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:407
msgid ""
"Load a Groupon or Wowcher code file. Codes already used stay used, however "
"often you import."
msgstr ""
"Indlæs en Groupon- eller Wowcher-kodefil. Koder, der allerede er brugt, "
"forbliver brugt, uanset hvor ofte du importerer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:408
msgid "Honor the amount paid"
msgstr "Respekter det betalte beløb"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:408
msgid ""
"When a deal's promotional value ends, its unused codes switch to what the "
"buyer paid, as Groupon's terms require."
msgstr ""
"Når en deals kampagneværdi udløber, skifter dens ubrugte koder til det, "
"køberen har betalt, som Groupons vilkår kræver."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:409
msgid "Report redemptions"
msgstr "Rapporter indløsninger"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:409
msgid ""
"A list of redeemed codes to copy into Groupon Merchant Center or upload to "
"Wowcher, and a reminder before payday."
msgstr ""
"En liste over indløste koder, du kan kopiere ind i Groupon Merchant Center "
"eller uploade til Wowcher, og en påmindelse før udbetalingsdagen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:410
msgid "Deal results"
msgstr "Dealresultater"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:410
msgid ""
"Codes redeemed, spend beyond the voucher, new customers and repeat orders "
"for each deal."
msgstr ""
"Indløste koder, forbrug ud over vouchern, nye kunder og gentagne ordrer for "
"hver deal."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:416
msgid ""
"Commission rules for your products in AffiliateWP, and referrals for "
"subscriptions, pay-later orders and refunds."
msgstr ""
"Provisionsregler for dine produkter i AffiliateWP samt henvisninger for "
"abonnementer, betal-senere-ordrer og refusioner."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:417
msgid "Pay your affiliates the right commission on every order"
msgstr "Betal dine affiliates den rette provision på hver ordre"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:427
msgid ""
"Version 1.0 applies its product rates only to the classic checkout, so "
"orders from the one-page checkout, Stripe, Square and PayPal earn "
"AffiliateWP's default rate instead. Version 2.0 applies them to every order, "
"moves them into EasyCart › Extensions › AffiliateWP, and adds referrals for "
"subscriptions, pay-later orders and refunds. Your rates move over on their "
"own."
msgstr ""
"Version 1.0 anvender sine produktsatser kun på den klassiske kasse, så "
"ordrer fra kassen på én side, Stripe, Square og PayPal i stedet får "
"AffiliateWPs standardsats. Version 2.0 anvender dem på alle ordrer, flytter "
"dem til EasyCart › Udvidelser › AffiliateWP og tilføjer henvisninger for "
"abonnementer, betal-senere-ordrer og refusioner. Dine satser flyttes "
"automatisk over."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:429
msgid "Commission rules"
msgstr "Provisionsregler"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:429
msgid ""
"A percentage or an amount per item on chosen products, for chosen affiliates "
"or everyone."
msgstr ""
"En procentdel eller et beløb pr. vare på udvalgte produkter, for udvalgte "
"affiliates eller alle."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:430
msgid "Every order counts"
msgstr "Hver ordre tæller"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:430
msgid ""
"Subscriptions and payments that finish after checkout earn a referral too."
msgstr ""
"Abonnementer og betalinger, der gennemføres efter kassen, giver også en "
"henvisning."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:431
msgid "Paid, then earned"
msgstr "Først betalt, så tjent"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:431
msgid "Pay-later orders earn once paid; refunds take the commission back."
msgstr ""
"Betal-senere-ordrer giver provision, når de er betalt; refusioner trækker "
"provisionen tilbage."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:437
msgid ""
"Product tabs that sell: size charts, nutrition labels, specifications, FAQs "
"and video in ten tab styles, built from blocks or an industry template."
msgstr ""
"Produktfaner, der sælger: størrelsesguider, næringsmærkater, "
"specifikationer, FAQ'er og video i ti fanestile, bygget af blokke eller en "
"branchetemplate."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:438
msgid "Product tabs that sell"
msgstr "Produktfaner, der sælger"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:447
msgid ""
"Version 3.0 edits tabs in the product editor, adds shared tabs, a tab "
"designer with 36 blocks, industry templates and ten tab styles. Your tabs "
"carry over and keep their look until you choose a new style, and they keep "
"showing until you update."
msgstr ""
"Version 3.0 redigerer faner i produkteditoren og tilføjer delte faner, en "
"fanedesigner med 36 blokke, branchetemplates og ti fanestile. Dine faner "
"overføres og beholder deres udseende, indtil du vælger en ny stil, og de "
"bliver ved med at blive vist, indtil du opdaterer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:450
msgid ""
"Version 1.0.11 is an important update for the tabs you have now. They carry "
"over unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Version 1.0.11 er en vigtig opdatering til de faner, du har nu. De overføres "
"uændret."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:452
msgid "A tab designer"
msgstr "En fanedesigner"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:452
msgid ""
"Build each product's tabs from 36 blocks, size charts to nutrition labels, "
"beside a live preview."
msgstr ""
"Byg hvert produkts faner af 36 blokke, fra størrelsesguider til "
"næringsmærkater, ved siden af en live-forhåndsvisning."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:453
msgid "Templates for your industry"
msgstr "Templates til din branche"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:453
msgid ""
"Fourteen ready-made sets of tabs, from apparel to supplements, in one click."
msgstr "Fjorten færdige sæt faner, fra tøj til kosttilskud, med ét klik."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:454
msgid "Ten tab styles"
msgstr "Ti fanestile"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:454
msgid ""
"Stacked sections, accordions, pills and more, a style for phones, or beside "
"the product photos."
msgstr ""
"Stablede sektioner, accordions, pills og mere, en stil til mobiler eller ved "
"siden af produktbillederne."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:455
msgid "Shared tabs"
msgstr "Delte faner"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:455
msgid ""
"Write Shipping & returns once and show it on every product, a category or a "
"manufacturer."
msgstr ""
"Skriv Forsendelse og returnering én gang, og vis det på hvert produkt, en "
"kategori eller en producent."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:459
msgid "WordPress User Sync"
msgstr "WordPress User Sync"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:461
msgid ""
"One login for your store and your WordPress site: customers are WordPress "
"users, and roles follow what they buy."
msgstr ""
"Ét login til din webshop og dit WordPress-site: kunder er WordPress-brugere, "
"og roller følger det, de køber."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:462
msgid "One login for your store and your WordPress site"
msgstr "Ét login til din webshop og dit WordPress-site"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:469
msgid ""
"Version 2.0 gives WordPress User Sync a settings page, links your existing "
"customers to their WordPress accounts and fixes sign-in problems between the "
"store and WordPress. Customers keep signing in until you update."
msgstr ""
"Version 2.0 giver WordPress User Sync en indstillingsside, kobler dine "
"eksisterende kunder til deres WordPress-konti og løser login-problemer "
"mellem webshoppen og WordPress. Kunderne kan fortsat logge ind, indtil du "
"opdaterer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:471
msgid "One login"
msgstr "Ét login"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:471
msgid ""
"Customers sign in once, with their WordPress password, on the store or the "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Kunder logger ind én gang med deres WordPress-adgangskode, i webshoppen "
"eller på sitet."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:472
msgid "Roles from purchases"
msgstr "Roller ud fra køb"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:472
msgid ""
"A product or an active subscription gives a WordPress role, for membership "
"and course plugins."
msgstr ""
"Et produkt eller et aktivt abonnement giver en WordPress-rolle, til "
"medlemskabs- og kursus-plugins."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:473
msgid "Link existing customers"
msgstr "Kobl eksisterende kunder"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:473
msgid ""
"A dry run first, then every customer joined to their WordPress account "
"safely."
msgstr ""
"Først en prøvekørsel, derefter bliver hver kunde sikkert koblet til sin "
"WordPress-konto."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:479
msgid ""
"Confirms a shopper's age with BlueCheck before age-restricted products are "
"sold, on every checkout, and keeps a record of each check on the order."
msgstr ""
"Bekræfter en kundes alder med BlueCheck, før aldersbegrænsede produkter "
"sælges, i alle kasser, og gemmer en registrering af hver kontrol på ordren."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:480
msgid "Check ages before restricted products sell"
msgstr "Kontroller alder, før begrænsede produkter sælges"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:488
msgid ""
"Version 1 checks age on the classic checkout's first step only, so orders "
"from the one-page checkout, express buttons and subscriptions are not "
"checked. Version 2.0 checks every order at Place order and keeps a record of "
"each check. Your BlueCheck account keeps working after the update."
msgstr ""
"Version 1 kontrollerer kun alderen i den klassiske kasses første trin, så "
"ordrer fra kassen på én side, ekspresknapper og abonnementer ikke "
"kontrolleres. Version 2.0 kontrollerer hver ordre ved \"Afgiv ordre\" og "
"gemmer en registrering af hver kontrol. Din BlueCheck-konto fortsætter med "
"at virke efter opdateringen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:490
msgid "Every checkout"
msgstr "Alle kasser"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:490
msgid ""
"One-page and classic, express buttons and subscriptions, checked at Place "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Kassen på én side og den klassiske, ekspresknapper og abonnementer, "
"kontrolleret ved \"Afgiv ordre\"."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:491
msgid "Your rules"
msgstr "Dine regler"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:491
msgid ""
"Only the categories and products you choose, at 18, 19 or 21, with states "
"you cannot ship to."
msgstr ""
"Kun de kategorier og produkter, du vælger, fra 18, 19 eller 21 år, med "
"stater, du ikke kan sende til."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:492
msgid "A record of every check"
msgstr "En registrering af hver kontrol"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:492
msgid ""
"The result, method and BlueCheck reference on the order, kept for four years."
msgstr "Resultatet, metoden og BlueCheck-referencen på ordren, gemt i fire år."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:493
msgid "Verify once"
msgstr "Bekræft én gang"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:493
msgid "Customers who passed are not asked again for a year."
msgstr "Kunder, der har bestået, bliver ikke spurgt igen i et år."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:497
msgid "Store manager apps"
msgstr "Apps til webshopadministration"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:499
msgid ""
"Manage orders and products from the iPhone, iPad and Android apps, or the "
"desktop app for Windows and Mac. The apps check your license when you sign "
"in."
msgstr ""
"Administrer ordrer og produkter fra apps til iPhone, iPad og Android eller "
"desktop-appen til Windows og Mac. Apps'ene tjekker din licens, når du logger "
"ind."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:506
msgid "iPhone & iPad"
msgstr "iPhone & iPad"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:509
msgid "WP EasyCart on the App Store"
msgstr "WP EasyCart i App Store"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:512
msgid "Android"
msgstr "Android"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:515
msgid "WP EasyCart on Google Play"
msgstr "WP EasyCart på Google Play"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:518
msgid "Windows & Mac"
msgstr "Windows & Mac"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:521
msgid "The WP EasyCart desktop app for Windows and Mac"
msgstr "WP EasyCart desktop-appen til Windows og Mac"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:525
msgid "Orders on the go"
msgstr "Ordrer på farten"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:525
msgid "See new orders and update them from your phone."
msgstr "Se nye ordrer, og opdater dem fra din telefon."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:526
msgid "Products and stock"
msgstr "Produkter og lager"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:526
msgid "Edit prices and stock from any device."
msgstr "Rediger priser og lager fra enhver enhed."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:527
msgid "A desktop app too"
msgstr "Også en desktop-app"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:527
msgid "The same tools on your computer."
msgstr "De samme værktøjer på din computer."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:533
msgid "Synced EasyCart subscribers to Mailchimp lists."
msgstr "Synkroniserede EasyCart-abonnenter til Mailchimp-lister."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:538
msgid ""
"Mailchimp shut down the API this extension used, so it no longer does "
"anything. The Email Marketing extension connects your store to Mailchimp or "
"Klaviyo instead."
msgstr ""
"Mailchimp har lukket den API, denne udvidelse brugte, så den gør ikke "
"længere noget. Udvidelsen Email Marketing forbinder i stedet din webshop med "
"Mailchimp eller Klaviyo."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:796
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:1593
msgid "Activate WP EasyCart Premium"
msgstr "Aktiver WP EasyCart Premium"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:798
msgid ""
"Extensions update through WP EasyCart Premium, which is installed on this "
"site but not active."
msgstr ""
"Udvidelser opdateres via WP EasyCart Premium, som er installeret på dette "
"websted, men ikke aktivt."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:801
msgid ""
"Extensions update through WP EasyCart Premium, which is not installed on "
"this site yet."
msgstr ""
"Udvidelser opdateres via WP EasyCart Premium, som endnu ikke er installeret "
"på dette websted."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:806
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:1587
#: admin/template/registration/registration-status-v2.php:227
msgid "Install WP EasyCart Premium"
msgstr "Installer WP EasyCart Premium"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:813
msgid "Get WP EasyCart Premium"
msgstr "Hent WP EasyCart Premium"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_extensions.php:865
