#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:648
msgid ""
"The beauty of WP EasyCart is that each product description is easily "
"customizable using what is titled the administrative console. Not only does "
"this component allow you to update and manage the whole website, it also "
"provides a simple, easy to use means of providing unique pictures, "
"descriptions, and specifications for each individual product!"
msgstr ""
"Det smukke ved WP EasyCart er, at hver produktbeskrivelse let kan tilpasses "
"ved hjælp af det, der hedder den administrative konsol. Ikke kun giver denne "
"komponent dig mulighed for at opdatere og administrere hele hjemmesiden, den "
"giver også et enkelt, let at bruge middel til at levere unikke billeder, "
"beskrivelser og specifikationer for hvert enkelt produkt!"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:648
msgid ""
"Your options with the administrative console are nearly endless. Do you want "
"to bolster sales by showing similar items on product pages? No problem! The "
"administrative console allows you to quickly set prices and sale prices, "
"attach the product to multiple menu locations, add options (i.e. color and "
"size) for each product, and optimize search engine key words and "
"descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Dine muligheder med den administrative konsol er næsten uendelige. Vil du "
"styrke salget ved at vise lignende varer på produktsiderne? Intet problem! "
"Den administrative konsol giver dig mulighed for hurtigt at indstille priser "
"og salgspriser, vedhæfte produktet til flere menupunkter, tilføje muligheder "
"(dvs. farve og størrelse) for hvert produkt og optimere søgemaskinens "
"nøgleord og beskrivelser."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:648
msgid ""
"Want customer feedback, also not a problem with WP EasyCart! We offer a five "
"star feedback system that allows for customer reviews."
msgstr ""
"Ønsker kundefeedback, heller ikke et problem med WP EasyCart! Vi tilbyder et "
"femstjernet feedback-system, der giver mulighed for kundeanmeldelser."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:648
msgid ""
"If the ease of use for this software isn't a large enough selling point, "
"consider the download capabilities. This software package is capable of "
"accommodating downloadable merchandise, including gift cards. This "
"capability expands the potential services of this software by allowing for "
"software downloads, music downloads, and photography businesses. This "
"software is flexible and customizable. It fits into every business style, "
"and businessperson's lifestyle."
msgstr ""
"Hvis brugervenligheden af denne software ikke er et tilstrækkeligt stort "
"salgsargument, skal du overveje downloadmulighederne. Denne softwarepakke er "
"i stand til at rumme varer, der kan downloades, herunder gavekort. Denne "
"evne udvider de potentielle tjenester i denne software ved at give mulighed "
"for download af software, musikdownloads og fotografering af virksomheder. "
"Denne software er fleksibel og kan tilpasses. Det passer ind i enhver "
"forretningsstil og forretningsmands livsstil."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:648
msgid ""
"WP EasyCart is a company that prides itself on customer service and constant "
"improvement. As part of this demo, we request that you provide feedback in "
"our forum. As a company we are always looking for the next step and to "
"provide the best options. Your feedback is essential for this process."
msgstr ""
"WP EasyCart er et firma, der er stolt af kundeservice og konstant "
"forbedring. Som en del af denne demo beder vi dig om at give feedback i "
"vores forum. Som virksomhed er vi altid på udkig efter det næste trin og for "
"at give de bedste muligheder. Din feedback er vigtig for denne proces."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:653
msgid ""
"This short description is useful for Search Engines to locate and display a "
"small sentence or two regarding your product.  You should limit this text to "
"a couple of sentences max."
msgstr ""
"Denne korte beskrivelse er nyttig for søgemaskiner til at finde og vise en "
"lille sætning eller to vedrørende dit produkt. Du bør begrænse denne tekst "
"til et par sætninger maks."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:654
msgid "seo keywords, easycart keywords, ecommerce keywords"
msgstr "seo nøgleord, easycart nøgleord, e-handels nøgleord"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:697
msgid "Great"
msgstr "Super"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:701
msgid "Pretty Good"
msgstr "Ret godt"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:709
msgid "Poor"
msgstr "Dårlig"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:713
msgid "The Worst"
msgstr "Det værste"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_initial_setup.php:717
msgid ""
"This is a sample customer review and 5 star rating system. Each product can "
"be designated to show a review and ratings are automatically calculated by "
"EasyCart. All reviews go through an approval before they can be listed on "
"the site and calculated, giving you the EasyCart owner control over what "
"content may accidentally get posted."
msgstr ""
"Dette er et eksempel på en kundeanmeldelse og et 5-stjernet "
"klassificeringssystem. Hvert produkt kan udpeges til at vise en anmeldelse, "
"og vurderinger beregnes automatisk af EasyCart. Alle anmeldelser gennemgår "
"en godkendelse, før de kan vises på webstedet og beregnes, hvilket giver dig "
"EasyCart-ejeren kontrol over, hvilket indhold der ved et uheld kan blive "
"sendt."

