#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:73
msgid ""
"Enter your site key and secret key and save them, then test them here. "
"reCAPTCHA can be switched on once they pass."
msgstr ""
"Indtast og gem din sidenøgle og din hemmelige nøgle, og test dem derefter "
"her. reCAPTCHA kan slås til, når de består testen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:79
msgid "Test again"
msgstr "Test igen"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:86
msgid ""
"These keys were already in use before this update. Test them again any time."
msgstr ""
"Disse nøgler var allerede i brug før denne opdatering. Du kan teste dem igen "
"når som helst."

#. translators: %s: date the keys passed the test.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:97
#, php-format
msgid "These keys passed a test on %s."
msgstr "Disse nøgler bestod en test den %s."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:107
msgid ""
"Your keys changed, so reCAPTCHA is off on your forms until these keys pass a "
"test."
msgstr ""
"Dine nøgler er ændret, så reCAPTCHA er slået fra på dine formularer, indtil "
"disse nøgler består en test."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:116
msgid ""
"Not tested yet. reCAPTCHA can be switched on once these keys pass a test."
msgstr ""
"Ikke testet endnu. reCAPTCHA kan slås til, når disse nøgler har bestået en "
"test."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:131
msgid "Save your key changes first: the test uses the saved keys."
msgstr "Gem først dine nøgleændringer: testen bruger de gemte nøgler."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:134
msgid ""
"Tick the box. Google then checks your answer with the secret key. If the box "
"shows an error instead, the site key is wrong, is not a v2 \"I'm not a "
"robot\" key, or does not list this site's domain."
msgstr ""
"Sæt kryds i feltet. Google kontrollerer derefter dit svar med den hemmelige "
"nøgle. Hvis feltet i stedet viser en fejl, er sidenøglen enten forkert, ikke "
"en v2-nøgle til “Jeg er ikke en robot” eller uden dette websteds domæne på "
"listen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:154
msgid "Loading the reCAPTCHA box…"
msgstr "Indlæser reCAPTCHA-feltet…"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:155
msgid "Checking with Google…"
msgstr "Kontrollerer hos Google…"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:156
msgid "The box expired. Tick it again."
msgstr "Feltet er udløbet. Sæt kryds i det igen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:157
msgid ""
"Google’s reCAPTCHA script could not load. Check your connection or any "
"script blocker, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Googles reCAPTCHA-script kunne ikke indlæses. Tjek din forbindelse eller en "
"eventuel scriptblocker, og prøv igen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:173
msgid ""
"Google does not recognise the secret key. Copy it again from your reCAPTCHA "
"admin console."
msgstr ""
"Google genkender ikke den hemmelige nøgle. Kopiér den igen fra din reCAPTCHA-"
"administrationskonsol."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:176
msgid "The box expired or was already used. Tick it again."
msgstr "Feltet er udløbet eller er allerede brugt. Sæt kryds i det igen."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:179
msgid ""
"The secret key does not belong to this site key. Both keys must come from "
"the same reCAPTCHA site."
msgstr ""
"Den hemmelige nøgle hører ikke til denne sidenøgle. Begge nøgler skal komme "
"fra samme reCAPTCHA-websted."

#. translators: %s: Google's error codes.
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:182
#, php-format
msgid "Google refused the test ( %s )."
msgstr "Google afviste testen ( %s )."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:182
msgid "no reason given"
msgstr "ingen årsag oplyst"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_recaptcha.php:195
