#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:642
msgid "Enable FedEx"
msgstr "Aktiver FedEx"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:642
msgid ""
"Quotes FedEx services with the REST API key and secret from your FedEx "
"developer project."
msgstr ""
"Tilbyder FedEx-tjenester med REST API-nøglen og hemmeligheden fra dit FedEx-"
"udviklerprojekt."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:644
msgid "API secret key"
msgstr "API hemmelig-nøgle"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:649
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:670
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:684
msgid "Rate multiplier"
msgstr "betalingstakst"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:649
msgid ""
"Converts FedEx’s quote currency to yours, or pads every rate. 1.000 leaves "
"quotes as they are."
msgstr ""
"Konverterer FedEx' tilbudsvaluta til din, eller angiver hver kurs. 1.000 "
"efterlader tilbud, som de er."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:650
msgid "Check for business addresses"
msgstr "Søg efter virksomhedsadresser"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:650
msgid ""
"Asks FedEx whether the address is residential or business before quoting, so "
"business rates apply where they should. Needs Address Validation Service "
"permission on your FedEx project."
msgstr ""
"Spørger FedEx, om adressen er til privat eller erhvervsmæssig brug, før du "
"giver et tilbud, så virksomhedspriserne gælder, hvor de skal. Har brug for "
"tilladelse til adressevalidering på dit FedEx-projekt."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:652
msgid "Use FedEx account discounts"
msgstr "Brug FedEx-kontorabatter"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:652
msgid "Quotes your negotiated FedEx rates instead of list rates."
msgstr "Angiver dine forhandlede FedEx-priser i stedet for listepriser."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:653
msgid "Sends requests to FedEx’s sandbox."
msgstr "Sender anmodninger til FedEx' sandkasse."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:657
msgid "UPS"
msgstr "UPS"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:659
msgid "Enable UPS"
msgstr "Aktivér UPS"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:659
msgid ""
"Quotes UPS services through your linked UPS account. Link the account below, "
"then fill in the shipper details."
msgstr ""
"Tilbyder UPS-tjenester via din tilknyttede UPS-konto. Tilknyt kontoen "
"nedenfor, og udfyld derefter afsenderoplysningerne."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:661
msgid "Shipper number"
msgstr "Afsendernummer"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:661
msgid "The six-character account number from your UPS profile."
msgstr "Kontonummeret på seks tegn fra din UPS-profil."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:663
msgid "Origin address line 1"
msgstr "Oprindelsesadresse linje 1"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:664
msgid "Origin address line 2"
msgstr "Oprindelsesadresse linje 2"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:665
msgid "Origin address line 3"
msgstr "Oprindelsesadresse linje 3"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:667
msgid "Origin state or province code"
msgstr "Oprindelsesstat eller provinskode"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:667
msgid "Two-character code, for example NY or ON."
msgstr "Kode på to tegn, f.eks. NY eller ON."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:670
msgid ""
"Converts UPS’s quote currency to yours, or pads every rate. 1.000 leaves "
"quotes as they are."
msgstr ""
"Konverterer UPS' tilbudsvaluta til din, eller angiver hver kurs. 1.000 "
"efterlader tilbud, som de er."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:671
msgid "Use negotiated rates"
msgstr "Brug forhandlede satser"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:671
msgid "Quotes your account’s negotiated rates when UPS returns them."
msgstr "Angiver din kontos forhandlede priser, når UPS returnerer dem."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:675
msgid "USPS"
msgstr "USPS"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:677
msgid "Enable USPS"
msgstr "Aktiver USPS"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:677
msgid ""
"Quotes USPS services through the USPS API. Uses the WP EasyCart USPS app "
"unless you enter your own credentials."
msgstr ""
"Tilbyder USPS-tjenester via USPS API. Bruger WP EasyCart USPS-appen, "
"medmindre du indtaster dine egne legitimationsoplysninger."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:678
msgid "Use my own USPS app"
msgstr "Brug min egen USPS-app"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:678
msgid ""
"Connect with a client ID and secret from your own USPS developer app instead "
"of the WP EasyCart app."
msgstr ""
"Opret forbindelse med et klient-id og en hemmelighed fra din egen USPS-"
"udvikler-app i stedet for WP EasyCart-appen."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:679
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "Client ID"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:679
msgid "From your USPS developer app."
msgstr "Fra din USPS-udvikler-app."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:680
msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "Hemmelig klient"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:681
msgid "Revert to USPS Web Tools"
msgstr "Vend tilbage til USPS-webværktøjer"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:681
msgid ""
"Only if you must: Web Tools stopped working in January 2026. Uses the Web "
"Tools username below."
msgstr ""
"Kun hvis du skal: Webværktøjer stoppede med at fungere i januar 2026. Bruger "
"webværktøjets brugernavn nedenfor."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:682
msgid "Web Tools username"
msgstr "Brugernavn til webværktøjer"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:682
msgid "The legacy USPS Web Tools user ID, usually in the form 123ABCD1234."
msgstr "Det ældre USPS Web Tools bruger-id, normalt i formularen 123ABCD1234."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:683
msgid "Origin ZIP code"
msgstr "Oprindelsespostnummer"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:684
msgid ""
"Converts USPS’s quote currency to yours, or pads every rate. 1.000 leaves "
"quotes as they are."
msgstr ""
"Konverterer USPS's tilbudsvaluta til din, eller angiver hver kurs. 1.000 "
"efterlader tilbud, som de er."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:685
msgid "Quote my account’s rates"
msgstr "Angiv min kontos satser"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:685
msgid ""
"Uses your USPS payment account for contract or commercial pricing instead of "
"retail."
msgstr ""
"Bruger din USPS-betalingskonto til kontrakt- eller kommerciel prissætning i "
"stedet for detailhandel."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:686
msgid "Retail"
msgstr "Detail"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:686
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "Kontrakt"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:686
msgid "Commercial"
msgstr "Kommerciel"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:686
msgid "Price type"
msgstr "Pristype"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "Enterprise Payment System ( EPS )"
msgstr "Enterprise Payment System ( EPS )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "Permit"
msgstr "Tilladelse"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "PC Postage meter"
msgstr "frankeringsmaskine"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "Mailer ID ( MID )"
msgstr "Mailer-ID ( MID )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:687
msgid "Payment account type"
msgstr "Betalingskonto"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:688
msgid ""
"The EPS account, permit number, meter number or MID that matches the type "
"above."
msgstr ""
"EPS-kontoen, tilladelsesnummeret, målernummeret eller MID, der matcher typen "
"ovenfor."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:689
msgid "CRID"
msgstr "CRID"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:689
msgid "Customer Registration ID of the business the account belongs to."
msgstr "Kunderegistrerings-id for den virksomhed, kontoen tilhører."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:711
msgid "The box editor is not available on this install."
msgstr "Æskeeditoren er ikke tilgængelig på denne installation."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:765
msgid "Royal Mail 2nd Class"
msgstr "Royal Mail 2nd Class"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:766
msgid "Royal Mail 1st Class"
msgstr "Royal Mail 1st Class"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:767
msgid "Royal Mail 2nd Class Signed For"
msgstr "Royal Mail 2nd Class Signed For"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:768
msgid "Royal Mail 1st Class Signed For"
msgstr "Royal Mail 1st Class Signed For"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:769
msgid "Royal Mail Tracked 48"
msgstr "Royal Mail Tracked 48"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:770
msgid "Royal Mail Tracked 24"
msgstr "Royal Mail Tracked 24"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:771
msgid "Royal Mail Special Delivery Guaranteed by 1pm"
msgstr "Royal Mail Special Delivery Guaranteed by 1pm"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:772
msgid "Royal Mail International Standard"
msgstr "Royal Mail International Standard"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:773
msgid "Royal Mail International Tracked"
msgstr "Royal Mail International Tracked"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:774
msgid "Royal Mail International Economy"
msgstr "Royal Mail International Economy"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:790
msgid "Services"
msgstr "Tjenester"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:790
msgid ""
"Pick the services shoppers can choose, rename them, and charge Royal Mail’s "
"price, a percentage more or less, or a fixed price."
msgstr ""
"Vælg de tjenester, kunder kan vælge mellem, omdøb dem, og opkræv Royal Mails "
"pris, en procentdel mere eller mindre, eller en fast pris."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:793
msgid "UK"
msgstr "Storbritannien"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:793
msgid "International"
msgstr "International"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:808
msgid "Prices follow Royal Mail’s price changes"
msgstr "Priserne følger Royal Mails prisændringer"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:808
msgid ""
"Royal Mail changes its prices in April and October. The new prices reach "
"your store before their date and take over on the day, without an update."
msgstr ""
"Royal Mail ændrer sine priser i april og oktober. De nye priser når din "
"webshop før deres dato og træder i kraft på dagen, uden en opdatering."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:818
msgid "How shipping is charged, what shoppers can choose, and where you ship."
msgstr ""
"Hvordan forsendelsen opkræves, hvad kunderne kan vælge, og hvor du sender."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:830
msgid "Whether you charge shipping and how rates are worked out"
msgstr "Om du opkræver fragt, og hvordan priserne beregnes"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:834
msgid "Charge shipping at checkout"
msgstr "Opkræv betaling for forsendelse ved kassen"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:835
msgid ""
"Off means no shipping address or rate is collected and every order is "
"treated as not shipped. The rest of this page only applies when it is on."
msgstr ""
"Off betyder, at der ikke indsamles nogen leveringsadresse eller -pris, og "
"hver bestilling behandles som ikke afsendt. Resten af denne side gælder kun, "
"når den er tændt."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:842
msgid "How rates are calculated"
msgstr "Sådan beregnes priser"

#. translators: %s: plan name, Pro or Premium ( Pro/Premium when no license is known ).
#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:844
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pick the system, then build its rate table on the Shipping rates page. Live "
"carrier rates and Fraktjakt are included with %s."
msgstr ""
"Vælg systemet, og opbyg derefter dets pristabel på siden Forsendelsespriser. "
"Live carrier satser og Fraktjakt er inkluderet med %s."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:854
msgid "Handling fee"
msgstr "Ekspeditionsgebyr"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:855
msgid ""
"Added on top of every shipping rate as a flat handling charge. Leave at 0 "
"for none."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjet oven i hver forsendelsespris som et fast ekspeditionsgebyr. Lad "
"være ved 0 for ingen."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:867
msgid "Expedited shipping surcharge"
msgstr "Fremskyndet forsendelsestillæg"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:868
msgid ""
"Offers an expedited choice at the standard rate plus this amount. Price, "
"weight, quantity and percentage systems only; 0 hides the choice."
msgstr ""
"Tilbyder et fremskyndet valg til standardprisen plus dette beløb. Kun pris-, "
"vægt-, mængde- og procentsystemer; 0 skjuler valget."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:881
msgid "Dimension units"
msgstr "Dimensionsenheder"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:882
msgid ""
"Used when product dimensions drive option pricing or are sent to a live "
"carrier."
msgstr ""
"Bruges, når produktdimensioner driver prissætningen af optioner eller sendes "
"til et live luftfartsselskab."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:885
msgid "Standard ( inches )"
msgstr "Standard ( tommer )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:886
msgid "Metric ( centimetres )"
msgstr "Metrisk ( centimeter )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:898
msgid "Options at checkout"
msgstr "Muligheder ved kassen"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:899
msgid "What shoppers see and can choose when shipping is charged"
msgstr "Hvad shoppere ser og kan vælge, når forsendelsen opkræves"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:903
msgid "Hide rates until an address is entered"
msgstr "Skjul priser, indtil en adresse er indtastet"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:904
msgid ""
"The cart page shows no shipping estimate; rates appear once the shopper "
"gives their address at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Indkøbskurvsiden viser ingen leveringsoverslag. Priserne vises, når kunden "
"oplyser sin adresse ved kassen."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:912
msgid "Offer free local pickup"
msgstr "Tilbyd gratis lokal afhentning"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:913
msgid "Adds a no-cost local pickup choice next to your shipping rates."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjer et lokalt afhentningsvalg uden omkostninger ved siden af dine "
"forsendelsespriser."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:921
msgid "Ship to the billing address only"
msgstr "Send kun til faktureringsadressen"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:922
msgid ""
"Removes the separate shipping address form; shoppers are told orders go to "
"their billing address."
msgstr ""
"Fjerner den separate leveringsadresseformular; shoppere får at vide, at "
"bestillinger går til deres faktureringsadresse."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:930
msgid "Charge shipping on subscriptions"
msgstr "Opkræv fragt på abonnementer"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:931
msgid ""
"Collects a shipping address and adds a rate when a subscription product is "
"marked shippable."
msgstr ""
"Indsamler en leveringsadresse og tilføjer en pris, når et abonnementsprodukt "
"er markeret som afsendbart."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:939
msgid "Static methods charge per item"
msgstr "Statiske metoder opkræver pr. vare"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:940
msgid ""
"A static method’s rate is multiplied by the number of items instead of "
"charged once per order."
msgstr ""
"En statisk metodes sats ganges med antallet af varer i stedet for at blive "
"opkrævet én gang pr. bestilling."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:950
msgid "Free shipping also covers partner shipping"
msgstr "Gratis forsendelse dækker også partnerforsendelse"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:951
msgid ""
"When your free shipping applies ( a free-shipping threshold, promotion or "
"coupon ), items a fulfillment partner ships are free to the shopper too and "
"you pay the partner’s shipping. Off, shoppers still pay the partner’s "
"shipping."
msgstr ""
"Når din gratis forsendelse gælder ( en grænse for gratis forsendelse, en "
"kampagne eller en kupon ), er varer, som en opfyldelsespartner sender, også "
"gratis for kunden, og du betaler partnerens forsendelse. Slået fra betaler "
"kunderne stadig partnerens forsendelse."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:963
msgid "Boxes and packing"
msgstr "Æsker og pakning"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:964
msgid ""
"The boxes you ship in. Orders are split into packages from them, and a label "
"is bought for each package."
msgstr ""
"De æsker, du sender i. Ordrer deles op i pakker ud fra dem, og der købes en "
"forsendelsesetiket til hver pakke."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:969
msgid "Pack new orders into boxes"
msgstr "Pak nye ordrer i æsker"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:970
msgid ""
"Each new order is split into packages when it is placed; older orders are "
"packed the first time you open them."
msgstr ""
"Hver ny ordre deles op i pakker, når den afgives; ældre ordrer pakkes første "
"gang, du åbner dem."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:982
msgid "What happens when tracking says an order arrived"
msgstr "Hvad der sker, når sporingen siger, at en ordre er nået frem"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:986
msgid "Mark orders delivered from tracking"
msgstr "Markér ordrer som leveret ud fra sporing"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:987
msgid ""
"When a label service reports that every package on a paid order arrived, the "
"order moves to the status below."
msgstr ""
"Når en etikettjeneste melder, at alle pakker på en betalt ordre er nået "
"frem, flyttes ordren til nedenstående status."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:994
msgid "Delivered status"
msgstr "Status for leveret"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:995
msgid ""
"The status a delivered order moves to. Rename it or change its colour under "
"Order statuses."
msgstr ""
"Den status, en leveret ordre flyttes til. Omdøb den, eller skift dens farve "
"under Ordrestatusser."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1008
msgid "How rates fetched from a carrier are quoted and shown"
msgstr "Sådan bliver priser, der hentes fra et fragtfirma, tilbudt og vist"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1012
msgid "Show estimated delivery days"
msgstr "Vis anslåede leveringsdage"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1013
msgid ""
"Adds the carrier’s transit estimate after each live rate, where the carrier "
"provides one."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjer transportørens transittestimat efter hver livepris, hvor "
"transportøren leverer en."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1022
msgid "Quote each item as its own parcel"
msgstr "Angiv hver vare som sin egen pakke"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1023
msgid ""
"Live rates are requested per item and added up, instead of one combined "
"package."
msgstr ""
"Livepriser anmodes om pr. artikel og lægges sammen i stedet for én "
"kombineret pakke."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1032
msgid "Always show overridden rates"
msgstr "Vis altid tilsidesatte satser"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1033
msgid ""
"A live rate you have replaced with a fixed amount is shown even when the "
"carrier returns no rate for the address. Off hides it in that case."
msgstr ""
"En livepris, du har erstattet med et fast beløb, vises, selv når "
"transportøren ikke returnerer nogen pris for adressen. Af skjuler det i så "
"fald."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1044
msgid "Carrier accounts"
msgstr "Speditørkonti"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1045
msgid ""
"USPS, UPS, FedEx, DHL, Canada Post and Australia Post credentials and origin "
"details. A carrier quotes once its details are complete."
msgstr ""
"USPS-, UPS-, FedEx-, DHL-, Canada Post- og Australia Post-"
"legitimationsoplysninger og oprindelsesoplysninger. Et fragtfirma giver et "
"tilbud, når oplysningerne er fuldstændige."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1053
msgid ""
"Royal Mail postage at checkout for shops that post from the UK, priced from "
"Royal Mail’s own price lists"
msgstr ""
"Royal Mail-porto i kassen for webshops, der sender fra Storbritannien, "
"beregnet ud fra Royal Mails egne prislister"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1060
msgid "Offer Royal Mail at checkout"
msgstr "Tilbyd Royal Mail i kassen"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1061
msgid ""
"Adds the Royal Mail services you pick to the live rates shoppers choose "
"from, priced by each parcel’s size, weight and destination. Needs Live "
"carrier rates as the shipping method."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjer de Royal Mail-tjenester, du vælger, til de live-priser, kunder kan "
"vælge mellem, beregnet efter hver pakkes størrelse, vægt og destination. "
"Kræver Live transportørpriser som forsendelsesmetode."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1071
msgid ""
"Online prices are what Royal Mail charges through Click & Drop; Post Office "
"prices are for stamps and the counter."
msgstr ""
"Onlinepriser er det, Royal Mail opkræver via Click & Drop; Post Office-"
"priser gælder for frimærker og skranken."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1073
msgid "Online ( Click & Drop )"
msgstr "Online ( Click & Drop )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1074
msgid "Post Office"
msgstr "Post Office"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1092
msgid "Size for products without measurements"
msgstr "Størrelse for produkter uden mål"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1093
msgid ""
"Royal Mail prices by size. A product with no length, width and height is "
"sent at least this size."
msgstr ""
"Royal Mail prissætter efter størrelse. Et produkt uden længde, bredde og "
"højde sendes mindst i denne størrelse."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1095
msgid "Large Letter"
msgstr "Stort brev"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1096
msgid "Small Parcel"
msgstr "Lille pakke"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1097
msgid "Medium Parcel"
msgstr "Mellemstor pakke"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1109
msgid "VAT in Tracked prices"
msgstr "Moms i Tracked-priser"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1110
msgid ""
"Royal Mail’s Tracked prices include 20% VAT. Leave it out when your tax "
"settings add VAT to shipping, so it is not charged twice."
msgstr ""
"Royal Mails Tracked-priser inkluderer 20% moms. Udelad den, når dine "
"momsindstillinger lægger moms på forsendelsen, så den ikke opkræves to gange."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1112
msgid "Include it, as Royal Mail prints them"
msgstr "Medtag den, som Royal Mail angiver dem"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1113
msgid "Leave it out"
msgstr "Udelad den"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1126
msgid "Add the collection charge"
msgstr "Tilføj afhentningsgebyret"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1127
msgid ""
"Adds Royal Mail’s charge for collecting from you to each parcel ( 50p in the "
"October 2026 prices )."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjer Royal Mails gebyr for at afhente fra dig til hver pakke ( 50p i "
"priserne fra oktober 2026 )."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1147
msgid "Check for new Royal Mail prices"
msgstr "Tjek for nye Royal Mail-priser"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1148
msgid "Your store checks once a day; this checks now."
msgstr "Din webshop tjekker én gang om dagen; dette tjekker nu."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:1157
msgid "Fraktjakt account"
