msgstr "Se hvert besøg, landingssiden og kampagne-tags"

#: inc/classes/core/class-wp-easycart-order-source.php:1193
msgid "AI assistants"
msgstr "AI-assistenter"

#: inc/classes/core/class-wp-easycart-order-source.php:1212
msgid ""
"See which sources bring your sales, ChatGPT and other AI assistants included"
msgstr ""
"Se, hvilke kilder der giver dig salg, inklusive ChatGPT og andre AI-"
"assistenter"

#: inc/classes/core/class-wp-easycart-order-source.php:1213
msgid ""
"Every order already records where it came from. The example above shows how "
"the card breaks them down."
msgstr ""
"Hver ordre registrerer allerede, hvor den kom fra. Eksemplet ovenfor viser, "
"hvordan kortet fordeler dem."

