"Until Stripe takes your card payments, subscription products can't be "
"bought, so the duration has no effect."
msgstr ""
"Indtil Stripe håndterer dine kortbetalinger, kan abonnementsprodukter ikke "
"købes, så varigheden har ingen effekt."

