"Kassen spørger ikke Vatlayer endnu: den kræver, at moms er slået til, at "
"\"Momsregistreringsnummer\" er slået til under Indstillinger › Kasse, og at "
"\"Bekræft momsnumre med Vatlayer\" er slået til."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:486
msgid "This link has expired"
msgstr "Dette link er udløbet. "

#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:486
msgid ""
"We couldn’t confirm this unsubscribe link. Please use the link in the most "
"recent email, or contact us and we’ll stop the reminders for you."
msgstr ""
"Vi kunne ikke bekræfte dette afmeldingslink. Brug linket i den seneste e-"
"mail, eller kontakt os, så stopper vi påmindelserne for dig."

#. translators: %s: masked email address, e.g. j***@example.com
#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:489
#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:497
#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:515
#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:518
msgid "You’re unsubscribed"
msgstr "Du er afmeldt"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:489
msgid ""
"This was a test email, so nothing was changed. A real customer clicking this "
"link stops all cart reminders to their address."
msgstr ""
"Dette var en test-e-mail, så intet blev ændret. En rigtig kunde, der klikker "
"på dette link, stopper alle påmindelser om indkøbskurv til deres adresse."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:497
#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:515
msgid "We won’t send you any more reminders about items left in your cart."
msgstr ""
"Vi sender dig ikke flere påmindelser om varer, der er tilbage i din "
"indkøbskurv."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:502
msgid "Yes, unsubscribe"
msgstr "Ja, afmeld mig"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:503
msgid "Keep me subscribed"
msgstr "Hold mig tilmeldt"

#. translators: %s: masked email address, e.g. j***@example.com
#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:507
#, php-format
msgid "Stop cart reminder emails to %s?"
msgstr "Vil du stoppe indkøbskurvpåmindelses-e-mails til %s?"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:508
msgid ""
"You won’t get any more reminders about items left in your cart. Order "
"confirmations and other emails about your purchases are not affected."
msgstr ""
"Du får ikke flere påmindelser om varer, der er tilbage i din indkøbskurv. "
"Ordrebekræftelser og andre e-mails om dine køb påvirkes ikke."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:518
#, php-format
msgid ""
"We won’t send any more reminders about items left in a cart to %s. Order "
"confirmations and other emails about your purchases are not affected."
msgstr ""
"Vi sender ikke flere påmindelser om varer, der er tilbage i en indkøbsvogn, "
"til %s. Ordrebekræftelser og andre e-mails om dine køb påvirkes ikke."

#. translators: %s: store name
#: inc/classes/core/ec_abandoned_carts.php:643
#, php-format
msgid "Continue to %s"
msgstr "Fortsæt til %s"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:128
msgid "WordPress mail (wp_mail)"
msgstr "WordPress-mail (wp_mail)"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:128
msgid "EasyCart built-in SMTP"
msgstr "EasyCart indbygget SMTP"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:128
msgid "EasyCart built-in PHP mail()"
msgstr "EasyCart indbygget PHP mail()"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:128
msgid "Custom (third-party hook)"
msgstr "Brugerdefineret (tredjepartskrog)"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:128
msgid "Queue"
msgstr "Kø"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:384
msgid ""
"Simulated failure — this is the \"simulate a failed send\" test, no mail was "
"sent."
msgstr ""
"Simuleret fejl — dette er \"simulere en mislykket afsendelse\" -testen, der "
"blev ikke sendt nogen mail."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:492
msgid "Not sent: there is no email address to send it to."
msgstr "Ikke sendt: der er ingen e-mailadresse at sende den til."

#. translators: %s: the example address, youremail@url.com
#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:495
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Not sent: %s is the example address. Enter your own under Settings › Email › "
"Store notification addresses."
msgstr ""
"Ikke sendt: %s er eksempeladressen. Indtast din egen under Indstillinger › E-"
"mail › Webshoppens notifikationsadresser."

#. translators: %s: what was entered as the address
#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:498
#, php-format
msgid "Not sent: \"%s\" is not a valid email address."
msgstr "Ikke sendt: \"%s\" er ikke en gyldig e-mailadresse."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:712
msgid "Every 5 minutes (EasyCart)"
msgstr "Hvert 5. minut (EasyCart)"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:822
msgid "That email is no longer in the queue."
msgstr "Denne e-mail er ikke længere i køen."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:923
msgid ""
"Automatic retry is off, so a failed email would simply be reported as "
"failed. Turn on \"Retry failed emails automatically\" in the email log to "
"try this."
msgstr ""
"Automatisk genforsøg er slået fra, så en mislykket e-mail vil simpelthen "
"blive rapporteret som mislykket. Slå \"Prøv mislykkede e-mails automatisk "
"igen\" til i e-mail-loggen for at prøve dette."

#. translators: %s: store name.
#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:930
#, php-format
msgid "Retry queue test from %s ( this email is never delivered )"
msgstr "Prøv køtest fra %s igen ( denne e-mail bliver aldrig leveret )"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:931
msgid ""
"This is the \"simulate a failed send\" test from WP EasyCart. Every attempt "
"fails on purpose so you can watch the retry queue: it is queued, retried "
"after 1 minute, 10 minutes, 1 hour and 6 hours, then marked failed after the "
"fifth attempt."
msgstr ""
"Dette er \"simulere en mislykket afsendelse\" testen fra WP EasyCart. Hvert "
"forsøg mislykkes med vilje, så du kan se forsøgskøen igen: den sættes i kø, "
"forsøges igen efter 1 minut, 10 minutter, 1 time og 6 timer og markeres "
"derefter som mislykket efter det femte forsøg."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:932
msgid "No mail server is contacted and no customer receives anything."
msgstr "Ingen mailserver kontaktes, og ingen kunde modtager noget."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:938
msgid "The test message could not be queued. Check that automatic retry is on."
msgstr ""
"Testmeddelelsen kunne ikke sættes i kø. Kontroller, at automatisk genforsøg "
"er slået til."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:992
msgid ""
"The mail server rejected the login. This usually means an app password was "
"regenerated, two-step verification changed, or the account was locked for "
"suspicious activity."
msgstr ""
"Mailserveren afviste login. Dette betyder normalt, at en appadgangskode blev "
"regenereret, totrinsbekræftelse ændret, eller at kontoen blev låst på grund "
"af mistænkelig aktivitet."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:992
msgid "Update the SMTP password / app password"
msgstr "Opdater SMTP-adgangskoden/app-adgangskoden"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:993
msgid ""
"The server could not reach the mail host. Hosts often block outbound SMTP "
"ports (25, 465, 587), or the hostname/port is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Serveren kunne ikke nå mailværten. Værter blokerer ofte udgående SMTP-porte "
"(25, 465, 587), eller værtsnavnet/porten er forkert."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:993
msgid "Check host and port, or ask your host whether SMTP is blocked"
msgstr "Tjek vært og port, eller spørg din vært, om SMTP er blokeret"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:994
msgid ""
"The encrypted connection failed. The encryption type usually needs to match "
"the port: TLS with 587, SSL with 465."
msgstr ""
"Den krypterede forbindelse mislykkedes. Krypteringstypen skal normalt matche "
"porten: TLS med 587, SSL med 465."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:994
msgid "Match encryption to port"
msgstr "Match kryptering til port"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:995
msgid ""
"The server refused the \"from\" address. Most providers only send from "
"addresses on domains you have verified with them."
msgstr ""
"Serveren afviste \"fra \"-adressen. De fleste udbydere sender kun fra "
"adresser på domæner, du har bekræftet med dem."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:995
msgid "Use a from address on your own, verified domain"
msgstr "Brug en fra-adresse på dit eget, bekræftede domæne"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:996
msgid ""
"The account hit a sending limit (Gmail and most free tiers cap daily "
"volume). Mail after the cap fails until the window resets."
msgstr ""
"Kontoen nåede en afsendelsesgrænse (Gmail og de fleste gratis niveauer "
"begrænser den daglige volumen). Mail efter hætten svigter, indtil vinduet "
"nulstilles."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:996
msgid "Move to a transactional provider without a daily cap"
msgstr "Flyt til en transaktionsudbyder uden et dagligt loft"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:997
msgid ""
"The receiving server rejected the mail for failing authentication (SPF/DKIM/"
"DMARC)."
msgstr ""
"Den modtagende server afviste mailen for manglende godkendelse (SPF/DKIM/"
"DMARC)."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:997
msgid "Add SPF and DKIM records for your sending service"
msgstr "Tilføj SPF- og DKIM-poster til din afsendelsestjeneste"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:998
msgid "PHPMailer could not be loaded on this server."
msgstr "PHPMailer kunne ikke indlæses på denne server."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:998 inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1131
#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1151
msgid "Switch to WordPress mail"
msgstr "Skift til WordPress-mail"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1001
msgid "The mail server returned an error."
msgstr "Serveren returnerede en fejl."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1001
msgid "Check the email settings and send a test"
msgstr "Tjek e-mailindstillingerne, og send en test"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1118
msgid "No valid \"from\" address"
msgstr "Ingen gyldig \"fra \"-adresse"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1118
msgid "Order emails need a sender address. Receivers reject mail without one."
msgstr ""
"Ordre-e-mails skal have en afsenderadresse. Modtagere afviser post uden en."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1118
msgid "Set the from address"
msgstr "Indstil adressen"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1120
#, php-format
msgid "Sending \"from\" a %s address"
msgstr "Sender \"fra\" en %s adresse"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1120
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Order emails are sent from %1$s. Gmail, Yahoo and Microsoft reject or spam-"
"folder mail claiming to be from their domains when it isn't sent by them. "
"Use an address on your own domain, e.g. orders@%2$s."
msgstr ""
"Ordre-e-mails sendes fra %1$s. Gmail, Yahoo og Microsoft afviser eller spam-"
"mappe mail, der hævder at være fra deres domæner, når den ikke er sendt af "
"dem. Brug en adresse på dit eget domæne, f.eks. ordrer@%2$s."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1120
msgid "Change from address"
msgstr "Skift fra adresse"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1122
msgid "From address is on a different domain than the store"
msgstr "Fra-adressen er på et andet domæne end butikken"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1122
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Mail is sent from %1$s but the store is %2$s. That is fine if you control "
"both domains and %1$s has SPF/DKIM for your sending service."
msgstr ""
"Mail sendes fra %1$s, men butikken er %2$s. Det er fint, hvis du styrer "
"begge domæner og %1$s har SPF/DKIM til din afsendelsestjeneste."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1124
msgid "From address is on your own domain"
msgstr "Fra-adressen er på dit eget domæne"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1131
msgid "Your SMTP plugin isn't in the path"
msgstr "Dit SMTP-plugin er ikke på vej"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1131
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s is active, but EasyCart is set to use its %2$s. SMTP plugins only "
"affect WordPress mail, so order emails bypass it."
msgstr ""
"%1$s er aktiv, men EasyCart er indstillet til at bruge sin %2$s. SMTP-"
"plugins påvirker kun WordPress-mail, så bestillings-e-mails omgår det."

#. translators: %s: mail plugin name, e.g. Post SMTP
#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1138
#, php-format
msgid "Your emails are sent by %s"
msgstr "Dine e-mails sendes af %s"

#. translators: %s: mail plugin name
#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1140
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Good: a dedicated mail plugin usually delivers better than your server's "
"default mail. Send a test from %s and confirm it reports success."
msgstr ""
"Godt: et dedikeret mail-plugin leverer normalt bedre end din servers "
"standardmail. Send en test fra %s, og bekræft, at den rapporterer succes."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1147
msgid "No mail plugin: emails use your server's basic mail"
msgstr "Intet e-mail-plugin: e-mails bruger din servers grundlæggende mail"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1147
msgid ""
"Many inboxes treat mail from a web server as suspicious, so receipts can "
"land in spam or go missing. Follow the 3 steps in \"Improve delivery\" to "
"fix it."
msgstr ""
"Mange indbakker behandler mail fra en webserver som mistænkelig, så "
"kvitteringer kan havne i spam eller forsvinde. Følg de 3 trin i \"Forbedr "
"levering\" for at rette det."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1147
msgid "How to set up an SMTP plugin"
msgstr "Sådan opsætter du et SMTP-plugin"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1149
msgid "WordPress mail with a mail plugin"
msgstr "WordPress mail med et mail-plugin"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1149
msgid "Another plugin configures the mailer."
msgstr "Et andet plugin konfigurerer maileren."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1151
#, php-format
msgid "Using %s"
msgstr "Brug af %s"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1151
msgid ""
"This works, but WordPress mail plus a dedicated mail plugin is what we "
"recommend: one place to configure, one set of logs, and API transports that "
"hosts can't block."
msgstr ""
"Dette virker, men WordPress mail plus et dedikeret mail-plugin er, hvad vi "
"anbefaler: ét sted at konfigurere, ét sæt logfiler og API-transporter, som "
"værter ikke kan blokere."

#. translators: %s: name of the send method another plugin set, e.g. Mandrill
#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1162
#, php-format
msgid "%s only sends some of your store emails"
msgstr "%s sender kun nogle af din webshops e-mails"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1163
msgid "Your custom send method only sends some of your store emails"
msgstr ""
"Din brugerdefinerede afsendelsesmetode sender kun nogle af din webshops e-"
"mails"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1164
msgid ""
"Another plugin set the send method, but it does not handle store "
"notifications, review requests, abandoned cart, back in stock or test "
"emails. EasyCart sends those with WordPress mail instead, so they can arrive "
"from a different server. While that plugin is on, the Send method setting "
"has no effect: to send every email one way, turn it off and use WordPress "
"mail with a mail plugin."
msgstr ""
"Et andet plugin har angivet afsendelsesmetoden, men det håndterer ikke "
"webshoppens notifikationer, anmodninger om anmeldelser, forladt kurv, "
"tilbage på lager eller test-e-mails. EasyCart sender dem i stedet med "
"WordPress-mail, så de kan komme fra en anden server. Mens det plugin er "
"aktivt, har indstillingen Afsendelsesmetode ingen effekt: for at sende alle "
"e-mails på én måde skal du slå det fra og bruge WordPress-mail med et "
"mailplugin."

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1165
msgid "Open Plugins"
msgstr "Åbn Plugins"

#: inc/classes/core/ec_email.php:1179
