"Kun nogle kunderoller kan se din webshop ( Indstillinger › Produkter › Hvem "
"kan se butikken ), så ingen produkter vises her for dig."

#: wpeasycart.php:4431
msgid ""
"This pricing table shows once WP EasyCart PRO is active and licensed, and "
"the plan group has tiers. Only store managers see this note."
msgstr ""
"Denne pristabel vises, når WP EasyCart PRO er aktivt og har en gyldig "
"licens, og plangruppen har niveauer. Kun butiksadministratorer ser denne "
"note."

#: wpeasycart.php:7197
msgid ""
"The payment page no longer matches the shopper’s cart session ( the page was "
"open for a long time, or the cart changed in another tab ). Square was not "
"asked to charge."
msgstr ""
"Betalingssiden matcher ikke længere kundens kurvsession ( siden har været "
"åben i lang tid, eller kurven blev ændret i en anden fane ). Square blev "
"ikke bedt om at opkræve betalingen."

#: wpeasycart.php:7335
msgid ""
"An item in the cart is no longer in stock in the quantity ordered "
"( stock_invalid ). Square was not asked to charge."
msgstr ""
"En vare i kurven er ikke længere på lager i den bestilte mængde "
"( stock_invalid ). Square blev ikke bedt om at opkræve betalingen."

#: wpeasycart.php:7345
msgid ""
"The cart is below the store’s minimum order total ( minimum_order ). Square "
"was not asked to charge."
msgstr ""
"Kurven er under webshoppens minimumsordresum ( minimum_order ). Square blev "
"ikke bedt om at opkræve betalingen."

#: wpeasycart.php:7350
msgid ""
"The store does not ship to the address on this order "
"( invalid_cart_shipping ). Square was not asked to charge."
msgstr ""
"Webshoppen leverer ikke til adressen på denne ordre "
"( invalid_cart_shipping ). Square blev ikke bedt om at opkræve betalingen."

#: wpeasycart.php:7356
msgid ""
"A fulfillment partner could not price shipping for its items to the address "
"on this order, or the order has no shipping country "
"( shipping_group_unavailable ). Square was not asked to charge."
msgstr ""
"En opfyldelsespartner kunne ikke beregne forsendelsen for sine varer til "
"adressen på denne ordre, eller ordren har intet leveringsland "
"( shipping_group_unavailable ). Square blev ikke bedt om at opkræve "
"betalingen."

#. translators: %s: checkout protection's reason code, such as protection_paused.
#: wpeasycart.php:7371
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Checkout protection held this payment ( %s ). Square was not asked to "
"charge; Settings › Checkout protection shows the activity."
msgstr ""
"Kassebeskyttelse tilbageholdt denne betaling ( %s ). Square blev ikke bedt "
"om at opkræve betalingen; Indstillinger › Kassebeskyttelse viser aktiviteten."

#: wpeasycart.php:7409
msgid "Duplicate charge"
msgstr "Dobbelt opkrævning"

#: wpeasycart.php:7410
msgid "Fraudulent"
msgstr "Svigagtig"

#: wpeasycart.php:7411
msgid "Requested by the customer"
msgstr "Anmodet af kunden"

#: wpeasycart.php:7412
msgid "The charge was never captured"
msgstr "Betalingen blev aldrig trukket"

#: wpeasycart.php:7438
msgid "Stripe, outside WP EasyCart"
msgstr "Stripe, uden for WP EasyCart"

#: wpeasycart.php:7612
msgid "Square’s card form did not load, so no payment could start."
msgstr ""
"Squares kortformular blev ikke indlæst, så ingen betaling kunne starte."

#: wpeasycart.php:7613
msgid "Square could not read the payment details."
msgstr "Square kunne ikke læse betalingsoplysningerne."

#: wpeasycart.php:7614
msgid ""
"Square’s card check ( buyer verification / 3-D Secure ) did not pass, so the "
"store was not asked to charge."
msgstr ""
"Squares kortkontrol ( køberverifikation / 3-D Secure ) blev ikke bestået, så "
"webshoppen blev ikke bedt om at opkræve betalingen."

#: wpeasycart.php:7615
msgid ""
"The payment request did not reach the store ( a network problem or a blocked "
"request )."
msgstr ""
"Betalingsanmodningen nåede ikke webshoppen ( et netværksproblem eller en "
"blokeret anmodning )."

#: wpeasycart.php:7616
msgid ""
"The store’s answer to the payment request could not be read, or had other "
"text printed around it."
msgstr ""
"Webshoppens svar på betalingsanmodningen kunne ikke læses, eller havde anden "
"tekst omkring sig."

#: wpeasycart.php:7617
msgid ""
"A script error stopped the payment before the store was asked to charge."
msgstr ""
"En scriptfejl stoppede betalingen, før webshoppen blev bedt om at opkræve "
"betalingen."

